Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.30,0:01:22.80,Title,0,0,0,0,,《教父2》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.33,0:01:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,教父的原名是 维多安东里尼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.93,0:01:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,诞生在西西里岛 的柯里昂村
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.49,0:01:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,1901年时 他的父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.09,0:01:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因侮辱当地的 黑手党老大被谋杀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.62,0:02:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的兄长保罗发誓要复仇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.23,0:02:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,却在山区里失去踪影
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.79,0:02:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下了维多在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.60,0:02:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为唯一男性
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.79,0:02:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在葬礼中陪伴他的母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.40,0:02:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当时才九岁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.83,0:03:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们杀了那个孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've killed the boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们杀了年轻的保罗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've killed young Paolo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.73,0:03:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们杀了你的儿子保罗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've killed your son Paolo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.43,0:03:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murderers! Murderers!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.70,0:03:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的儿子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.44,0:03:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的儿子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.75,0:04:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尊敬的西西欧阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All my respect, Don Ciccio.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.51,0:04:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,西西欧阁下…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don Ciccio…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.21,0:04:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你因我丈夫不肯 向你屈服而杀他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed my husband because he wouldn't give in to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.85,0:04:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及他的长子保罗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his oldest son Paolo…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.92,0:04:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他誓言要复仇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he swore revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.79,0:04:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但维多是我仅有的 而且笨手笨脚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Vito is only nine.And dumb-witted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.15,0:04:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从来不说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never speaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.82,0:04:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕的不是他的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not his words I'm afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.69,0:04:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很弱 不可能伤害任何人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's weak. He couldn't hurt anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.89,0:04:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他长大后会变得很强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when he grows, he'll grow strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.63,0:04:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 这小孩不会对你怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. This little boy can't do a thing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.73,0:05:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他长大以后会回来报仇的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he's a man, he'll come for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.93,0:05:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我求你 西西欧阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg you, Don Ciccio, spare my only son.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.27,0:05:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了我唯一的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all I have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.90,0:05:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我仅有的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all I have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.27,0:05:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对天发誓 他永远不会伤害你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to God he'll never do you any harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.07,0:05:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了他吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spare him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.05,0:05:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.58,0:05:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快逃 维多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, Vito!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.48,0:05:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动否则我杀了你！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move and I'll kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.55,0:05:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快逃！维多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, Vito!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.05,0:05:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.56,0:05:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何家庭收容了维多安东里尼 都会后悔的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any family who hides the boy Vito Andolini will regret it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.26,0:05:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.46,0:06:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何收容维多安东里尼的 都会有麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody who hides the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.24,0:06:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人收容了维多安东里尼…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anyone is hiding the boy Vito Andolini…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.58,0:06:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他交给我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…turn him over to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.28,0:06:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,西西欧阁下会谢谢你的 那对你及那孩子都好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don Ciccio will thank you for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.91,0:06:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人收容了维多安东里尼…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any family who hides the boy Vito Andolini…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.95,0:06:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多 我们会为你祈祷的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vito, we're praying for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.38,0:06:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何收容维多安东里尼的 都会有麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody who hides the boy Vito Andolini is in for trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.19,0:06:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他交给我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn him over to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.82,0:06:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,西西欧阁下会谢谢你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don Ciccio will thank you for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.22,0:07:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那对你及那孩子都好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be better for the boy, and better for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.10,0:07:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人收容了维多安东里尼…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any family who hides the boy Vito Andolini…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.18,0:08:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找护士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nurse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.03,0:09:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻译员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interpreter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.13,0:09:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪里来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.90,0:09:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.27,0:09:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧！孩子 你叫什么名字？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, son. What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.11,0:09:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.14,0:09:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,由柯里昂村来的维多安东里尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vito Andolini from Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.84,0:09:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂 维多柯里昂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corleone. Vito Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.08,0:09:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 到那边去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.65,0:09:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.05,0:09:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫什么名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.15,0:10:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他他有天花 要隔离三个月{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him he has smallpox. Quarantine three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.69,0:10:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多柯里昂？…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vito Corleone!Vito Corleone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.53,0:10:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这！他就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here he is. This is him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.55,0:11:09.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1901年 爱丽丝岛 维多柯里昂）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.39,0:11:23.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（他的孙子 安东尼维多柯里昂）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.29,0:11:28.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1958年 大浩湖 内华达州）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.76,0:12:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰德！把车钥匙拿来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you bring the car keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.38,0:12:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laurie! Laurie!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.97,0:12:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.23,0:12:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.07,0:12:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看是谁在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, who's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.37,0:12:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯梅诺神父！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father Carmelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这位是柯梅诺神父 - 我是梅尔强森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is Father Carmelo. - I'm Merle Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.07,0:12:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这教区的神父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}family parish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.97,0:13:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈！我回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama!Here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.64,0:13:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真搞不懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Constanzia,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.51,0:13:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来迟了一个星期？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}after one week?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.91,0:13:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上星期派车去机场接你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent the car to the airport last week to pick you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.02,0:13:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是场大灾难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.18,0:13:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我回来了 只是迟了一星期罢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, here I am, just one week late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.55,0:13:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是送给妈妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for my mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.38,0:13:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？- 你还记得梅尔吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is this? - You remember Merle?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.58,0:13:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. How are you? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.15,0:13:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克在哪？我得和他谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Michael? I gotta to talk to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.18,0:13:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,把几件事弄清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and um, get a few things straight,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.39,0:13:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能排队见他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can't wait on line.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.79,0:13:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先去看你的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go see your children first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.35,0:13:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再操心见你弟弟的事 你得和别人一样排队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you worry about waiting on line to see your brother. Like everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.79,0:13:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位先生女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.10,0:13:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最尊贵的来宾 想要说几句话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A most distinguished guest would like to say a few words.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.53,0:13:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,请欢迎内华达州的参议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please welcome Senator Pat Geary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.10,0:13:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,派特葛瑞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the State of Nevada.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.86,0:13:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有葛瑞太太{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there is Mrs. Geary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.20,0:14:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常谢谢各位先生女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much, Ladies and Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.31,0:14:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于我及内人而言 今天是个非常快乐的日子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a very, very happy day for me and my wife Mrs. Geary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.51,0:14:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们极少回来内华达州{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We see Nevada far too seldom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.91,0:14:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今天回来特别高兴 一来和老朋友相聚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But today we can join with old friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.74,0:14:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,二来我们能交到新的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can make new friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.98,0:14:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,三则是共同庆祝一个年轻人 首度领圣餐礼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we help celebrate a young man's first Communion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.41,0:14:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且也要谢谢那孩子的家庭 对于本州慷慨的捐献{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And also to thank that boy's family for a magnificent contribution to the State.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.55,0:14:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我手上有张支票{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have here in my hand a cheque.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.86,0:14:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,受款人是州立大学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}made out to the university,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.33,0:14:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且金额惊人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it is a magnificent endowment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.16,0:14:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是以安东尼维多柯里昂的 名义捐赠的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the name of Anthony Vito Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.46,0:14:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱是安东尼父母捐出来我们有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cheque is signed by that young man's parents,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.13,0:14:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,请这对善长站起来和大家见面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}whom I think we should recognise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.87,0:14:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,请站起来 让大伙们能看到你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, Pat, Kay. stand up, please. Let the folks see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.16,0:15:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 希望大家和我一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Folks, I want you to join me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.37,0:15:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,向麦克柯里昂先生夫人致谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in giving a real Nevada thank you to Mr. and Mrs. Michael Corleone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.97,0:15:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们同时有一个 特别安排的节目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We also have, as a special added attraction,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.27,0:15:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,西耶华儿童合唱团{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Sierra Boys Choir,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.34,0:15:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们特别挑选了一些歌曲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who have chosen a certain special song.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.31,0:15:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为这里的主人麦克柯里昂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a special arrangement to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所特别安排的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}honour their host, Mr. Michael Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.81,0:15:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.13,0:15:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,匾额{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plaque.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.16,0:15:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.89,0:15:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你们拍到了没？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fellows, did you get that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.26,0:15:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 参议员 麻烦你和柯里昂太太合照{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Senator, just you and Mrs. Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.63,0:16:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 那样就行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay that's enough, Senator.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.67,0:16:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,请把支票给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the cheque.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.33,0:16:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿高点让我们看得见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}higher, so we can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.57,0:16:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的律师汤姆哈金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lawyer Tom Hagen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.24,0:16:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛瑞参议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator Geary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.60,0:16:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他负责和你的手下 安排这整件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He arranged everything through your man Turnbull.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.85,0:16:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.61,0:16:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.21,0:16:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我们两个要单独谈话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well I was under the impression that you and I would talk alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.95,0:16:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人都是我的心腹 参议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust these men with my life, Senator.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.22,0:16:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是我要求他们离开 那就是侮辱他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To ask them to leave would be an insult.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.92,0:16:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.58,0:16:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是无所谓但是我得告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's perfectly all right with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.98,0:16:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个很直率的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I am a blunt man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.32,0:16:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我预备很坦白的对你说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I intend to speak very frankly to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.95,0:16:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许比从前任何一位 你遇过的参议员都要坦白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe more frankly than anyone in my position has ever talked to you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.59,0:17:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂家族在内华达 相当的成功{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Corleone family has done well in Nevada.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.86,0:17:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拥有或者说控制了 拉斯维加斯的主要旅馆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You own, or control, two major hotels in Vegas,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.90,0:17:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在雷诺还有一家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one in Reno.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.20,0:17:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,执照是早就有的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The licences were grandfathered in,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.80,0:17:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以在赌博委员会是没有问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so there was no problem with the Gaming Commission.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.83,0:17:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我的消息来源告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now my sources tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.97,0:17:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你计划预备去动托比卡拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you plan to make a move against the Tropigala.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.00,0:17:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们告诉我说在一周之内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tell me that, within a week,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.14,0:17:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会把他们给扫地出门了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're going to move Klingman out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.11,0:17:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个不小的扩充{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite an expansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.08,0:17:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你会遇到一个 技术上的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, it will leave you with a little technical problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.61,0:17:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,执照依然是克灵门的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The licence will still be in Klingman's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.68,0:17:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谭波是个好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turnbull is a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.54,0:17:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们废话少说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, let's cut out the bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.48,0:17:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想在这里浪费许多时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to spend more time here than I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.71,0:17:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以拥有执照{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have the licence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.02,0:17:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,代价是25万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The price is 250, 000 dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.05,0:17:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上每个月总收入的5%{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus five per cent of the gross monthly,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.96,0:18:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂先生 我是指四家旅馆合并的总收入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of all four hotels, Mr. Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.96,0:18:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在执照的价格不超过二万元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The price for the licence is less than 20, 000 dollars,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.19,0:18:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说的对不对？- 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Am I right? - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.27,0:18:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我为何要付 这么高的价格呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I pay more than that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.13,0:18:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我意图要压迫你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I intend to squeeze you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.06,0:18:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢你这一类的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like your kind of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.70,0:18:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢看到你油头粉面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like to see you come out to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.47,0:18:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿着那纯丝的西装{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this clean country in oily hair, dressed up in those silk suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.84,0:18:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,假装是位正直的美国人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and try to pass yourselves off as decent Americans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.74,0:18:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是和你做生意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do business with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但事实上我鄙视你的假面具{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the fact is that I despise your masquerade,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.85,0:18:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你那种不择手段 向上爬的做事方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the dishonest way you pose yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.91,0:18:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你他妈的整个家族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yourself, and your whole fucking family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.81,0:18:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,参议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.62,0:18:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们两个都是伪善的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we're both part of the same hypocrisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.12,0:19:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是永远也不要想 把我的家族拿来混为一谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But never think it applies to my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.22,0:19:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！有些人就是喜欢玩点小把戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right.Some people have to play little games.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.79,0:19:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你玩你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You play yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.96,0:19:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们这样说好了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.23,0:19:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是为了自己本身的利益 而付钱给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll pay me because it's in your interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.63,0:19:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天中午前我要你的答覆和钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want your answer and the money by noon tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.80,0:19:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事你不要再连络我了 永远不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more thing.Don't you contact me again, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.57,0:19:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,从今以后 你与罪犯去打交道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From now on you deal with Turnbull.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.80,0:19:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开门！小子 - 参议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Open that door, son. - Senator,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.00,0:19:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,想的话 我现在就能答覆你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can have my answer now if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.61,0:19:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要提供的是这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My offer is this:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.47,0:19:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.78,0:19:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至不付赌博执照的费用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even the fee for the gaming licence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.07,0:19:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你个人能提供那项费用 我会很感激的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which I would like you to put up personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.74,0:19:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位午安！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.88,0:20:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们 我不知道你们在外面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies! I didn't know you were out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.58,0:20:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我们必须走了 我们已经迟了30分钟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, we have to go. We're 30 minutes late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.35,0:20:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 真遗憾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.41,0:20:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂太太 真是个好派对 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been delightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.02,0:20:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们的荣幸 非常感谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was our pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.16,0:20:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你谈话真是愉快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was wonderful talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.47,0:20:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fredo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.64,0:21:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷多 你这个臭小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fredo, you son-of-a-bitch,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.75,0:21:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你气色看来真好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you look great!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.92,0:21:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰克潘坦居利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank Pentangeli!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.78,0:21:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你永远不会来西部你这大混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you was never coming out west you big bum!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.95,0:21:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总得照顾我的手下 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to check on my boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.65,0:21:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷多 这里的食物是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with the food here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.45,0:21:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 穿白色上衣的孩子端给我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the matter? - A kid comes up to mein a white jacket,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.29,0:21:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,几片饼干还有切碎的鹅肝 告诉我那是「可娜的和平」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}gives me a Ritz cracker, and uh, chopped liver, he says Canapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.85,0:21:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他说那是可娜和平个屁 那只是饼干配上碎鹅肝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, uh, can o' peas my ass, that's a Ritz cracker and chopped liver!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.60,0:21:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为任何人都…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, does anyone…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.02,0:21:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有烤肉 那香肠在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a barbecue here, so where's the sausage?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.33,0:21:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,把胡椒和香肠拿出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring out the peppers and sardines!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.10,0:21:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你让我想起了 纽约的昔日时光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing you reminds me of New York in the old days!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.80,0:21:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷多 你还记得威力奇契吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Fredo.You remember Willi Cicci.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.10,0:21:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们和克里曼沙 一起在布鲁克林 他…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who was with old man Clemenza in Brooklyn?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.11,0:21:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对他的事都很难过 法兰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were all upset about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.17,0:21:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是心脏病发作 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heart attack, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.53,0:21:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那不是心脏病发作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that was no heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.23,0:21:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我来这的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.27,0:21:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,来找你弟弟麦克谈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see your brother Mike about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.54,0:21:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是他是怎么回事？- 什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But what's with him? - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.68,0:22:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说我得先去找封介绍信？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I have to get a letter of introduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.18,0:22:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能见他？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get a sit-down?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.21,0:22:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你不能见到麦克？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't get in to see Mike?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.32,0:22:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要我在大厅等他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got me waiting in a lobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.25,0:22:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼欧拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny Ola.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.65,0:22:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾尔纳利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Al Neri.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.78,0:22:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼 你近来好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you, Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.95,0:22:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认得我的律师汤姆哈金 强尼欧拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know my lawyer Tom Hagen?Johnny Ola.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.75,0:22:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 老早就认得汤姆了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, I remember Tom from the old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.33,0:22:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗可 这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocco, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.39,0:22:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是迈阿密的柳丁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an orange from Miami.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.15,0:22:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去招呼一下强尼的人 他们看来有点饿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of Johnny's men. They look like they might be hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.23,0:22:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.70,0:22:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.40,0:22:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆不会在这陪我们 强尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom won't stay, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.76,0:22:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只处理一些特别事务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He only handles specific areas of the business.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.33,0:22:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.43,0:22:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.60,0:22:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要喝什么？强尼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you drinking, Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.57,0:22:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜂蜜酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anisette.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.87,0:22:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜂蜜酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anisette.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.11,0:23:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,若需要什么？麦克 我会在外面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you need anything, Mike, I'll be outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.58,0:23:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆 告诉罗可我们在等他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell Rocco we're waiting, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.61,0:23:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚留下罗斯先生在迈阿密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just left Mr. Roth in Miami.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.25,0:23:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的健康情况如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is his health?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.75,0:23:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.78,0:23:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能做些什么吗？能送他什么吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything I can do? Anything I can send?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.68,0:23:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 他很感激你的关心和尊敬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We appreciate your concen Michael and your respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.68,0:23:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有兴趣的那家赌场登记的是杰可劳伦斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That casino…Registered owners: Jacob Lawrence,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.76,0:23:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,和亚伦巴克莱 两个都是比佛利山的律师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allan Barclay. Beverly Hills attorneys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.96,0:23:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的主人是 克里夫兰的湖村路集团{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real owners are the old Lakeville Road group.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.09,0:23:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,及我们在迈阿密的 朋友克灵门负责经营{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and our friend in Miami.Meyer Klingman runs the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.75,0:23:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拥有一部分的主权 他弄的还好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He runs a piece of it too, he does alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.06,0:23:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我奉命告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've been instructed to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.56,0:23:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你想请克灵门出局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that if you move him out,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.36,0:23:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在迈阿密的朋友会同意的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}our friend in Miami will go along.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.20,0:23:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们真的很客气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very kind of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.30,0:23:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉他 我非常的感激{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him it's greatly appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.80,0:23:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,海门罗斯永远为他的搭档赚钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hyman Roth always makes money for his partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.40,0:24:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个接着一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One by one,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.84,0:24:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,昔日的好友都走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}our old friends are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.31,0:24:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.07,0:24:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是自然或其他因素{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}natural or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.84,0:24:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,入狱流亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}prison, deported…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.91,0:24:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,海门罗斯是唯一剩下的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hyman Roth is the only one left,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.38,0:24:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他永远替他的搭档赚钱！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he always made money for his partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.97,0:24:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.48,0:24:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有三十位职业的乐师在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of thirty professional musicians,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.41,0:24:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然没有一个意大利人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there isn't one Italian in, in the group here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.88,0:24:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！我们来点意大利的乐曲 奏吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have a tarantella! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.25,0:24:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你！站起来 快点 起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You! Up! Clarinet up, up, up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.85,0:24:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点吹！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Questa mano!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.70,0:24:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,吹！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Questa mano!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.43,0:25:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋 不是那个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell have we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.24,0:25:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要见我姐姐一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see my sister alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.67,0:25:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那和我也有关 我留下来可以吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It concerns me too.Is it okay, Mike, if I stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.08,0:25:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.64,0:25:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过梅尔 在拉斯维加斯的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've met Merle, he was with me in Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.58,0:25:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.34,0:25:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,能给我一杯酒吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could I have a drink or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.01,0:25:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要喝什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Que voi?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.88,0:25:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾尔 请你给他杯酒好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Al, would you please get him a drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.48,0:25:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们下周要去欧洲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to Europe next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.88,0:25:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想在皇后号上订位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to book passage on the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.38,0:25:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你来找我干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you come to me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.65,0:25:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何不去找旅行社呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go to a travel agent?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.49,0:25:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先要结婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting married first.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.25,0:25:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你离婚证书上的墨水还没有干{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ink on your divorce isn't dry yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.22,0:25:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就又要结婚了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're getting married?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.66,0:25:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只在周末看你的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see your children on weekends.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.36,0:26:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你的长子维特 在雷诺因行窃被捕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know your oldest boy, Victor, was picked up in Reno for some petty theft.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.90,0:26:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你甚至不晓得这件事 - 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- that you don't even know about. - Mikey.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.63,0:26:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和不在乎你的男人 在世界各处玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fly around the world with men who don't even care about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.73,0:26:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们像对妓女一样利用你 - 你不是我父亲！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and use you like a whore! - You're not my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.13,0:26:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你来找我干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what do you come to me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.57,0:26:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要钱！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I need money.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.21,0:26:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,康妮…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connie, Connie, Connie…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.61,0:26:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟你讲道理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna be reasonable with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.22,0:26:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何不留在这 和家族在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you stay with the family?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.08,0:26:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能住在这 和你的孩子在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can live on the estate with your kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.92,0:26:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会缺乏任何东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't be deprived of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.59,0:26:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以拥有任何你想要的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you can have everything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.02,0:26:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认识这位梅尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know this Merle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.32,0:26:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他是干什么的 他靠什么维生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what he does or what he lives on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.05,0:27:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉他结婚是不可能的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now why don't you tell him marriage is out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.22,0:27:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你不想再见到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you don't want to see him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.36,0:27:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会了解的 相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll understand, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.63,0:27:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,康妮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.61,0:27:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是不听我的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't listen to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.14,0:27:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,要嫁给这个男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and marry this man…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.23,0:27:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会令我很失望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you'll disappoint me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.66,0:28:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,「仙丹」是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's "Chen dannay"?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.09,0:28:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,「仙丹」意思是一百年！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Cent' anni". It means 100 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.26,0:28:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是我们都将 快乐的活一百年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means we should all live happily for 100 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.06,0:28:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在整个家族里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The family.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.53,0:28:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是父亲还活着那就是事实了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'd be true if my father were still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.53,0:28:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,康妮！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connie!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.13,0:28:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅尔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.27,0:28:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,见过我的嫂嫂蒂安娜！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've met my sister-in-law Deanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.27,0:28:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷多的太太{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fredo's wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.37,0:28:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的荣幸 - 久仰 也是我的荣幸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My pleasure. - How do you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.10,0:28:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们俩很相配 - 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're perfect. - mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.17,0:28:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说的是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did she mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.00,0:28:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,请恕我直言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.08,0:28:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是来这吃晚饭的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't come here to eat dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.25,0:28:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.43,0:29:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？我只是想跳舞而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter? I just, I just want to dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.86,0:29:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳舞是一回事 你已经东倒西歪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dancing is one thing, you're fallin' all over the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.39,0:29:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what's the matter with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.97,0:29:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在吃醋 因为他才是真正的男子汉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just jealous because he's a real man!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.33,0:29:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再说了 我会毒打你一顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to God, Deanna, I'm gonna belt you right in the teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.97,0:29:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你连你妈妈都不敢打{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't belt your mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.76,0:29:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？那些意大利人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know somethin'? These Dagos.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.40,0:29:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他们的老婆不乖时 他们就快疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}are crazy when it comes to their wives.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.00,0:29:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克说你若不能处理这件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael says that if you can't take care of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.81,0:29:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须处理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.37,0:29:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你去会好一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you better.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.90,0:29:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别嫁给意大利人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never marry a Wop.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.43,0:29:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对待你像狗屎一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They treat their wives like shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.31,0:29:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是有意说意大利人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean to say Wop.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.57,0:29:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦哦…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh, Ahh woo! Rocco! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.54,0:29:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？你这个大笨蛋 救命！弗雷多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing to me, you big slob? Help!Fredo!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.08,0:29:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我控制不了她 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't control her, Mikey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.68,0:29:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我哥哥 弗雷多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.88,0:29:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要对我道歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't have to apologize to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.72,0:30:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里曼沙答应在他死后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clemenza promised the Rosato brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.45,0:30:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,把布朗区的三块地盘 给罗萨多兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}three territories in the Bronx after he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.85,0:30:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你接管他的事业之后 并没有交给他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took over and didn't give it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.55,0:30:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不履行约定？- 你赖帐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I weltched? - You weltched.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.72,0:30:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里曼沙没答应他们什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clemenza promised them lu cazzo,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.06,0:30:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里曼沙并没有 承诺给他们什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clemenza promised them nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.03,0:30:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他比我还要恨那些王八蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hated those son of a bitches more than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.79,0:30:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰克 他们说你骗他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankie, they feel cheated.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.92,0:30:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克！你高高的坐在西耶华山上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sitting up in the Sierra Mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.16,0:30:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喝着…他喝的是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're drinking…What's he drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.46,0:30:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,香槟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Champagne.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.52,0:30:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,香槟 香槟鸡尾酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Champagne cocktails.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.49,0:30:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却替我裁决{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and passing judgement on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.20,0:30:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要如何经营我的家族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how I run my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.33,0:30:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的家族依然叫柯里昂！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your family's still called Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.24,0:30:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你要管理的像柯里昂家族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'll run it like a Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.63,0:30:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家族不吃这里的 也不在拉斯维加斯吃喝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family doesn't eat here, doesn't eat in Las Vegas…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.61,0:30:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,更不吃迈阿密的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and doesn't eat in Miami…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.74,0:30:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他的海门罗斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with Hyman Roth!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.07,0:31:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰克 你是个老好人 我喜欢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good old man, and I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.71,0:31:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年来你一直对我父亲忠诚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were loyal to my father for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.45,0:31:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗萨多兄弟在抓人质{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Rosato brothers are taking hostages.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.65,0:31:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 麦克！他已经把口水吐在我脸上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They spit right in my face,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.12,0:31:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,全因为迈阿密 那犹太人在支持着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all because they're backed up by that Jew in Miami.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.82,0:31:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.19,0:31:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我不要你惹他们的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I don't want them touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.79,0:31:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不要我惹他们 - 不要！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not touched? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.46,0:31:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你对他们公平点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to be fair with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.58,0:31:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我对他们公平点？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to be fair with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.25,0:31:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,天！你对禽兽如何公平？汤姆！看在老天的份上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you be fair to animals?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.56,0:31:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 他们吸纳西班牙人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom, listen. They recruit spics,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.96,0:31:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们吸纳黑人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they recruit niggers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.00,0:31:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在他们祖母的 邻近地区使用暴力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do violence in their grandmothers'neighbourhoods!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.00,0:31:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,且我告诉你 他们所有的勾当 都跟妓女和贩毒有关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everything with them is whores! And junk, dope!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.37,0:31:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把赌放在最后一位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they leave the gambling to last.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.93,0:31:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要管理我自己的家族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to run my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.87,0:31:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要你在背后支持{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}without you on my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.27,0:31:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而我要那些罗萨多兄弟的命 - 不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and I want those Rosato brothers dead! - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.97,0:31:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,要！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mort'
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.88,0:32:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我和海门罗斯 有重要的生意要做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I have business that's important with Hyman Roth.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.21,0:32:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要被骚扰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want it disturbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.61,0:32:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对犹太人的忠诚 远胜过对自己的血源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you give your loyalty to a Jew before your own blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.81,0:32:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 法兰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Frankie,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.14,0:32:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道家父和海门罗斯 做过生意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know my father did business with Hyman Roth.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.84,0:32:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很尊重他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He respected him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.22,0:32:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,令尊和海门罗斯做过生意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father did business with Hyman Roth,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.62,0:32:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,令尊尊重海门罗斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he respected Hyman Roth,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.15,0:32:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他从来不信任海门罗斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he never trusted Hyman Roth.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.12,0:32:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是他的西西里人信差 强尼欧拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or his Sicilian messenger boy Johnny Ola.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.15,0:32:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我先告退了 我有点累 又有点醉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to excuse me. I'm tired, and I'm a little drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.39,0:32:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我要这的每一位都知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want everybody here to know,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.96,0:32:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会为各位添任何的麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's not going to be no trouble from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.99,0:32:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.10,0:32:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇契 开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cicci, the door…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.37,0:32:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要他们现在离开吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want him to leave now?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.04,0:33:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们回纽约去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go back to New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.84,0:33:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经拟好我的计划了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've already made my plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.40,0:33:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那老头酒喝的太多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old man had too much wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.54,0:33:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,时候不早了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.49,0:33:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,胎儿好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.58,0:33:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我体内睡着了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleeping inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.55,0:33:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得是个男孩吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it feel like a boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.02,0:33:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是个男孩 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it does, Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.49,0:33:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.45,0:33:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉今天这些人来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about all the people today.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.09,0:33:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,时机不对 但是我也无能为力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad timing.It couldn't be helped, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.33,0:33:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,它让我想到你以前告诉过我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It made me think of what you once told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.67,0:33:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,五年内柯里昂家族事业 完全合法化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"In five years the Corleone family will be completely legitimate."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.99,0:34:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是七年前的事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was seven years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.27,0:34:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.47,0:34:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在尽力 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.80,0:35:02.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你喜欢吗？爸爸）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.90,0:35:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看过这个了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.47,0:35:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 窗帘为何是开着的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael, why are the drapes open?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.12,0:35:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯 你还好吗？- 我还好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kay, are you all right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.12,0:36:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有没有中弹？- 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you hit? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.86,0:36:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去了！…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.19,0:36:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门关起来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the door locked!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.50,0:36:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,停住！…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop, stop…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.20,0:36:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还在这里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're still on the property.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.64,0:36:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托！麦克！拜托你留在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please stay inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.94,0:36:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,要活口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep them alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.07,0:36:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们尽力 - 罗可！抓活口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll try. - Alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.11,0:36:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在门口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay by the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.88,0:36:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在房子附近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay around house.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.81,0:37:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.65,0:38:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.18,0:38:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.73,0:38:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有许多事我不能告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, there's a lot I can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.23,0:38:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道过去你因此而很颓丧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I now that's upset you in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.16,0:38:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有点儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.73,0:38:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得那表示缺少信任与信心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You felt it was because of some lack of trust or confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.07,0:38:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.60,0:38:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为我钦佩你而且我爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I admire you and love you,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.14,0:38:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才对你保守秘密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I kept things secret from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.64,0:38:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,也因此在这个时候 你是我唯一能信任的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're the only one I can trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.51,0:38:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷多？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fredo?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.44,0:38:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有个善良的心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's got a good heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.90,0:38:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他很懦弱而且很笨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's weak and he's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.54,0:38:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这是生死攸关的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}nd this is life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.45,0:38:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆！你是我的兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom, you're my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.49,0:39:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直希望你把我当成你兄弟 像亲兄弟一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always wanted to be thought of as a brother by you, Mikey. A real brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.16,0:39:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.39,0:39:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要接管一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.42,0:39:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将成为族长！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to be the Don.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.59,0:39:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是发生的事和我想的一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If what I think has happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.93,0:39:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今晚就要离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm leaving here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.96,0:39:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给予你完全的权力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give you complete power.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.93,0:39:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括弗雷多及他的手下 还有罗可 纳利所有人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over Fredo and his men. Rocco, Neri, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.74,0:39:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把我太太的性命交付给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trusting you with the lives of my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.30,0:39:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my children,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.17,0:39:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及这个家族的未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the future of this family.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.00,0:39:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是我们抓到这些傢伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we catch them,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.44,0:39:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看有否可能查出 幕后主使者吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will we find out…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.67,0:39:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要去抓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't catch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.67,0:39:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我错的离谱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless I'm very wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.97,0:39:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则他们应该已经死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.72,0:40:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,被一位很接近我们的人杀死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were killed by somebody close to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.11,0:40:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是内奸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.75,0:40:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常怕会曝光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very, very frightened that they botched it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.25,0:40:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你的人呢？罗可和纳利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think that Rocco and Neri.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.65,0:40:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会认为他们与此事有关吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}had something to do with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.99,0:40:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.52,0:40:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的人都是生意人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All our people are businessmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.85,0:40:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的忠诚是以那个为基础{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their loyalty is based on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.25,0:40:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我由爸爸那里学到了一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing I learned from Pop…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.27,0:40:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,试着想想你身边的人 会怎么想？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…was to try to think as people around you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.70,0:40:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在生意的基础上 凡事都有可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On that basis, anything is possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.56,0:40:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们死在那里 就在我窗户外面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, they're dead! Right outside my window!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.53,0:40:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要离开这里 否则死的是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to get out of here.They're lying there dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.90,0:40:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉她进去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get her in!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.94,0:41:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这边！他们有两个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here! There's two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.91,0:41:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来像是由纽约以外的人雇的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like they were hired out of New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.65,0:41:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认识他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't recognise them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.58,0:41:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在问不出什么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't get anything out of them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.08,0:41:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,看…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, look…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.47,0:41:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们解决掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fish them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.20,0:41:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 把尸体料理掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get rid of the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.49,0:41:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克到哪去了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Mike?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.83,0:41:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗可！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocco.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.58,0:42:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,安东尼！没事了 睡吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anthony, everything is going to be all right. Try to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.05,0:42:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢你的派对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you like your party?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.92,0:42:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我收到很多礼物 - 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got lots of presents. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.99,0:42:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢它们吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.53,0:42:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认得送我礼物的那些人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I didn't know the people who gave them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.00,0:42:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they were friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.67,0:42:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到我送你的礼物了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see my present for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.03,0:42:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就放在我的枕头上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was on my pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.53,0:42:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,安东尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anthony.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.73,0:43:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明天一大早就要离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to be leaving very early tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.27,0:43:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会带我去吗？- 不 我不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will you take me? - No, I can't, Anthony.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.04,0:43:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么事你必须要走？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you have to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.01,0:43:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是生意 我必须要去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to do business.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.74,0:43:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮你忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.35,0:43:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 有一天你会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Some day you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.58,0:43:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡一会吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.59,0:43:53.52,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1917年 纽约市 维多柯里昂）
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.58,0:44:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她非常美 你必须见见她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's really beautiful.You've got to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.83,0:45:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等着看她吧 言语无法形容她的美{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait till you see her. Words can't describe her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.50,0:45:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我离开了那普勒斯 离开了妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left Naples. I left Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.67,0:45:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了辛苦的漂泊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a no-good tramp!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.31,0:45:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我来到美国的纽约了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now here I am in America, in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.78,0:45:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,独自一人 想念我的妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alone! Thinking of my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.61,0:45:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何家中的消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without news from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.05,0:45:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enter!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.55,0:45:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pepino, a letter for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.82,0:45:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坐下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.52,0:45:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于那普勒斯来信了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally, a letter from Naples!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.42,0:45:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多 喜欢我的小天使吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vito, how do you like my little angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.35,0:46:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,美吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't she beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.66,0:46:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是很美{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.16,0:46:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你而言 她很美{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To you, she's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.52,0:46:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我心中只有我的妻子小孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me, there's only my wife and son.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.49,0:46:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.39,0:46:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈死了！妈妈…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our dear mother is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.49,0:47:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等会到后台去 带她去宵夜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go backstage later and take her to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.70,0:47:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坐下 笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down, you bum!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.16,0:47:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉！范伦奇阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, excuse me, Don Fanucci.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.44,0:47:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到后台去看她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go see her backstage.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.70,0:47:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是谁？- 黑手党{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who was that? - The Black Hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.12,0:48:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多 来吧！我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vito, come on…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.79,0:48:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们到后台去看她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on let's go see her backstage.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.15,0:48:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过！…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sorry…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.75,0:48:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.22,0:48:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是范伦奇 黑手党{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Fanucci… the Black Hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.09,0:48:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明天再说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll talk about it tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.03,0:48:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天！永远是明天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow! Always tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.93,0:48:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天就要付钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll pay me today!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.46,0:48:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.40,0:48:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快付钱 - 别弄我女儿 放过她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pay me now! - Not my daughter! Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.71,0:48:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这！我所有的钱都给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, take all my money!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.28,0:49:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多…走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vito, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.88,0:49:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多 我知道你怎么想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.89,0:49:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但事情不是那样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't know how things are.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.89,0:49:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,范伦奇是黑手党{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fanucci's with the Black Hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.62,0:49:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一带全都得付他钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole neighborhood pays him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.06,0:49:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是我开杂货店的爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even my father, in the grocery store.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.15,0:49:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是意大利人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's Italian…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.39,0:49:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为何要骚扰 其他的意大利人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…why does he bother other Italians?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.65,0:49:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道没别人保护他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows they have nobody to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.93,0:49:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管那个 喜欢我的小天使吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget that. Did you like my angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.79,0:49:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是你快乐 我就快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're happy, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.82,0:50:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作顺利吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you feel well?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.92,0:50:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老板对你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is your boss treating you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.42,0:50:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别提它了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.16,0:50:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,隔壁的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Paisan!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.00,0:50:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是意大利人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you speak Italian?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.10,0:50:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我保管一下 下星期我再回来拿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hide this for me!Next week. I'll come and get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.76,0:51:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿班达多 见过我的侄子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abbandando, meet my nephew!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.86,0:51:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,生意好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's business?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.83,0:51:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好！…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good, it's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.73,0:52:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,范伦奇疯了！说邻居在拖付钱的限期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fanucci's mad. Says the neighborhood's getting sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.81,0:52:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,说人们不准时付钱 不付全额的钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People don't pay on time, don't pay the full amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.48,0:52:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,说他对大家都太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says he's been too nice to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.21,0:52:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以范伦奇要改变了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Fanucci's changing?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.58,0:52:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 他想收双倍的钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. He wants double from everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.81,0:52:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至我父亲也要付双倍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even from my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.82,0:52:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的朋友 对不对？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a friend, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.69,0:52:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你会让他在这里做事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you'll let him work here?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.39,0:52:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多！过来一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vito, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.63,0:53:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一个坏消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got some bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.21,0:53:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实在不想告诉你这个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel rotten about telling you this…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.94,0:53:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但范伦奇…他有位侄子 而你必须把我的工作给他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Fanucci… he's got a nephew…And you have to give him my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.28,0:53:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从我来这起 就一直对我很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've always been good to me, ever since I came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.28,0:53:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你像父亲般照顾我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You looked after me like a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.09,0:53:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我谢谢你 而且我不会忘记{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thank you.And I won't forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.92,0:53:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vito!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.19,0:53:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.50,0:54:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.83,0:54:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个带回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this to your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.90,0:54:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 但是我不能接受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks anyway. But please, I can't accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.06,0:54:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给你的家人 - 我不能接受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take this to your family. - I can't accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.43,0:54:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.31,0:54:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好漂亮的梨子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a nice pear!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.53,0:55:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是克里曼沙 我的货还在你那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Clemenza, you still have my goods?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.24,0:55:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否看过里面了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you look inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.97,0:55:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对于不关我事的 东西没兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not interested in things that don't concern me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.98,0:55:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的一位朋友有张很好的地氈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friend of mine has a nice rug.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.68,0:55:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你太太会喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe your wife would like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.24,0:55:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她当然会 但谁有钱来买呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure she would. But who has money for a rug?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.82,0:55:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是件礼物 我晓得如何回报的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be a present. I know how to return a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.62,0:56:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然好 我太太会喜欢它的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure.My wife would like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.63,0:56:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.90,0:56:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那王八蛋 他不在家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The son of a bitch! He isn't home!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.14,0:56:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！甚至连钥匙都没留下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, he didn't even leave the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.17,0:56:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会介意的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he won't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.48,0:56:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先请！维多！请进吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in. Hey, Vito come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.22,0:57:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心！进来吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.33,0:57:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是你朋友的地方？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is your friend's place? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.80,0:57:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,真像一座皇宫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a real palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.17,0:57:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好的一座{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.50,0:57:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多！帮个忙 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vito, give me a hand, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.39,0:59:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看那有多漂亮！尚尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look how pretty it is, Santino!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.59,1:02:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.43,1:02:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系的 海门在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. Hyman's in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.96,1:02:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在弄午餐 你要来一个鲔鱼三明治吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like a tuna sandwich?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.46,1:02:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.51,1:02:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Roth?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.58,1:02:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, Michael.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.94,1:02:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐吧！像自己家一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down, make yourself comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.44,1:02:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,球赛快结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost over.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.52,1:02:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看足球赛吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you follow the football game?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.92,1:02:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一阵子没看了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for a while I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.89,1:02:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢在下午看足球赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I enjoy watching football in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.92,1:02:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我喜爱这国家的诸事之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the things I love about this country.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.79,1:02:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有棒球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baseball too.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.03,1:03:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就喜欢它了 从1919年阿诺罗斯坦 成立世界联盟以来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love bassball, ever since Arnold Rothstein fixed the World Series in 1919.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.93,1:03:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你遇到了麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you had some trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.16,1:03:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,太笨了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.06,1:03:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿枪做出那种行为来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People behaving like that with guns.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.97,1:03:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的是你安然无恙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The important thing is you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.87,1:03:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥有健康是最重要的事！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good health is the most important thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.87,1:03:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,比成功金钱来的重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than success, more than money.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.41,1:03:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,比权力更重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than power.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.55,1:03:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这是因为 将会有更多流血事件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came here because there's going to be more bloodshed.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.52,1:03:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你在一切开始前先知晓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted you to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.65,1:04:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,以免引发另一场战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so another war won't start.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.55,1:04:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人希望有另一场战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody wants another war.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.62,1:04:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰克潘坦居利到我家里来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank Pentangeli asked my permission.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.12,1:04:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他要求我的同意 除掉罗萨多兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get rid of the Rosato brothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.56,1:04:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我拒绝时 他试图杀了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I refused he tried to have me killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.98,1:04:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很笨我运气很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was stupid, I was lucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.62,1:04:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很快的会去拜访他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll visit him soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.50,1:04:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的是没有任何事 会妨碍我们对于未来的计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The important thing is that nothing interferes with ourplans for the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.76,1:04:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我意见相同 没有什么比那更重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing is more important.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.90,1:04:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个考虑周到的年轻人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a wise and considerate man.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.96,1:04:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你是位伟人 罗斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're a great man, Mr. Roth.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.93,1:04:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要向你学习很多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's much I can learn from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.57,1:04:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我能帮的上忙 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever I can do to help, Michael.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.07,1:04:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打扰了 午餐来了 - 进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. Lunch. - Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.14,1:04:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.80,1:04:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这干什么？会震破耳膜的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to break your eardrums.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.71,1:04:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 慢慢享用吧！- 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Enjoy it. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.92,1:04:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还年轻 我老了 又有病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're young, I'm old and sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.89,1:05:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在往后几个月所要做的事 可以创造历史{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we'll do in the next few months will make history.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.89,1:05:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是破天荒的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's never been done before.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.76,1:05:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至令尊作梦也想不到 会有可能做到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even your father would dream that such a thing could be possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.32,1:05:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,而法兰克潘坦居利该死 你没意见吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank Pentangeli is a dead man. You don't object?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.43,1:05:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是个小角色！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's small potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.23,1:05:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.97,1:05:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有客人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got company?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.33,1:05:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦克柯里昂来了 - 麦克柯里昂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Michael Corleone is here. - Michael Corleone?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.93,1:06:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在你的房里 你最好快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in your den. You better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.74,1:06:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他等了半个小时了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been waiting a half hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.68,1:06:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么不对了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.93,1:06:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.40,1:06:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你来之前 能先告知我一声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you would have let me know you were coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.00,1:06:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让我为你准备点什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have prepared something.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.53,1:06:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让你晓得我要来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want you to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.87,1:06:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听说我家发生的事了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard what happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.57,1:06:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 我差点没吓死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost died.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.17,1:06:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们后来才松了一口气 - 在我的家里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We were so relieved. - In my home!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.87,1:06:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的卧室 而我太太睡在那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my bedroom where my wife sleeps!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.61,1:06:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我孩子玩玩具的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where my children come to play.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.71,1:06:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my home.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.79,1:07:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你帮助我报复{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to help me take my revenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.75,1:07:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 任何事都可以 我能做些什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael, anything. What can I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.73,1:07:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,把和罗萨多兄弟间的 麻烦解决掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Settle these troubles with the Rosato brothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.06,1:07:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克！我不明白！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand. I don't…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.83,1:07:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 我没有你那种脑筋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have your brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.70,1:07:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,去做那些大生意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for big deals.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.07,1:07:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是市井之事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is a street thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.67,1:07:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个迈阿密的海门罗斯 他在支持那些王八蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Hyman Roth in Miami. He's backing up those sons-of-bitches.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.87,1:07:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他在支持{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.04,1:07:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么是为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.40,1:07:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何你要求我与他们谈和？麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why ask me to lay down to them?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.45,1:07:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是海门罗斯叫人杀我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Hyman Roth that tried to have me killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.62,1:07:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it was him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.82,1:07:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷！麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.25,1:08:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷！让我们干掉他们 去把他们全部都给做了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ, let's get them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.69,1:08:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁我们还有力量之前 现在就去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now while we've got the muscle.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.42,1:08:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里以前是家父的书房{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This used to be my father's old study.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.30,1:08:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.63,1:08:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还记得以前…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.16,1:08:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这有张大桌子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there used to be a big desk here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.03,1:08:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我还是孩子之时 在这附近玩耍都要很小声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember when I was a kid. We had to be quiet when we played near here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.60,1:08:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴这幢房子 始终不曾落入陌生人的手里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was very happy that this house never went to strangers.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.71,1:08:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是克里曼沙接手 现在是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First Clemenza took it over. Now you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.38,1:08:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,家父在这里教了我许多事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father taught me many things here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.18,1:08:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这间房间里教我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He taught me in this room.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.88,1:09:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他教我与朋友保持接近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He taught me, "Keep your friends close,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.58,1:09:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是敌人要更接近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but your enemies closer."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.05,1:09:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在若是海门罗斯看到 我出面协调这件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Hyman Roth sees that I interceded in this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.56,1:09:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮了罗萨多兄弟的忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the Rosato brothers' favour.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.33,1:09:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会认为与我的关然依然良好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll think his relationship with me is still good.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.33,1:09:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白吗？- 明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Capide? - Capide.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.70,1:09:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是要他那样想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I want him to think.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.83,1:09:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要他们完全的放松{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want him relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.87,1:09:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们的友谊有绝对的信心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and confident in our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.67,1:09:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就能查出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll be able to find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.14,1:09:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家族里的叛徒是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who the traitor in my family was.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.58,1:09:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷多！我是强尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fredo, this is Johnny Ola.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.16,1:10:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼欧拉！我们需要帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need some more help, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.02,1:10:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.12,1:10:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷 是什么时候了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ, what the hell time is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.30,1:10:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁？甜心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that, honey?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.83,1:10:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,听清楚 弗雷多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen good, Fredo,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.33,1:10:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何打电话到这里来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you calling me?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.13,1:10:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想和你谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.73,1:10:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,潘坦居利和罗萨多兄弟要开会 他说他会遵守他们的协定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pentangeli is going to accept the Rosato brothers' deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.33,1:10:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他会一个人来吗？- 我什么都不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will he come alone? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.93,1:10:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们使我陷的够深了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got me in deep enough already.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.64,1:10:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一起去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go along,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.00,1:10:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许协谈会很顺利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything will be all right,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.44,1:10:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷多 潘坦居利说他愿意达成协议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fredo, Pentangeli says he's willing to make a deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.34,1:10:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只想知道他是否说真话 还是会带手下一起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we want to know is if he's on the level, or if he'll bring his boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.74,1:10:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们对我说谎 不要再打电话给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied to me. I don't want you to call me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.91,1:10:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟弟不会查出我们交谈过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother won't find out we talked.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.24,1:10:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说些什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.35,1:10:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.05,1:10:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,打错电话的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong number.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.76,1:11:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我这里没有任何人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankie, I've got nobody here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.42,1:11:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在车上等 奇契{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait in the car, Cicc'.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.66,1:11:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 法兰克 - 没事的 奇契{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Frankie. - That's okay, Cicc'.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.46,1:11:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.87,1:11:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们新协议的幸运符{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lucky C note for our new deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.27,1:11:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,路契 给我们倒杯酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ritchie. Give us a taste.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.24,1:11:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对于你的决定都很高兴 法兰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were all real happy about your decision, Frankie.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.24,1:11:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会后悔的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't regret it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.01,1:11:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢这个标识 罗萨多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like the C note, Rosato.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.65,1:11:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为那是种侮辱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take that as an insult.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.44,1:11:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克叫我向你说声好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael Corleone says hello!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.00,1:12:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 把那扇门关起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close the door!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.16,1:12:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面有条子 怎么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend the cop…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.50,1:12:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,路契 里面很暗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Ritch. It's dark in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.20,1:12:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在营业中还是已休息？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you open or closed?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.80,1:12:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是进来整理一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just came in to clean up a little, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.01,1:12:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.37,1:12:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,地板上有东西吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that something on the floor?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.90,1:12:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别在这！… 安东尼 别在这！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carmine, not here! Anthony!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.97,1:12:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打开酒吧门 我就把你的脑袋给轰掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You open this bar and I'll blow your head in!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.47,1:13:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷多！看到你真好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy, it's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.41,1:13:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他怎样了？- 没事了 在后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How is he? - He's okay. He's in the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.81,1:13:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了！女孩们！闪到一边去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls, take a hike.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.58,1:13:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里这间房里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this room here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.22,1:13:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要先跟他单独谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to talk to him alone first.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.08,1:13:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.53,1:13:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我能帮助你 参议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I could help you, Senator.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.16,1:14:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈金？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hagen?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.32,1:14:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈金 我没有…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I did not…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.57,1:14:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.60,1:14:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都没有做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.93,1:14:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.07,1:14:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的运气很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very lucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.27,1:14:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弟弟弗雷多管理这个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother Fredo operates this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.90,1:14:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们最先通知他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was called before anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.87,1:14:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这若发生在别的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had this happened some place else.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.24,1:14:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也帮不了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we couldn't have helped you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.67,1:14:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我醒来时 我在地板上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I woke up, I was on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.31,1:14:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我不知道那是怎么发生的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't know how it happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.38,1:14:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记不起来了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.11,1:14:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I passed out.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.59,1:14:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我来整理！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…I picked!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.46,1:14:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一场游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a game. Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.32,1:15:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.80,1:15:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,主！…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus God!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.67,1:15:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是有上帝的话…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh God!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.41,1:15:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 而且我不了解为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, and I don't understand why.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.38,1:15:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记不起来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.55,1:15:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要记得 只要照我说的做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter, just do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.45,1:15:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,打个电话到你的办公室去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put in a call to your office.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.92,1:15:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,解释一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explain that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.25,1:15:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,说你明天下午会到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll be there tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.02,1:15:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你决定在达荷的 麦克柯里昂家里住一晚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You decided to spend the night at Michael Corleone's house in Tahoe.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.79,1:15:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得她在笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do remember that she was laughing.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.65,1:15:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前也玩过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd done it before.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.66,1:15:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我不可能伤害那个女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I know that I could not have hurt that girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.16,1:15:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女孩没有家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This girl has no family.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.03,1:15:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人知道她在这里工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody knows that she worked here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.73,1:16:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,等清理完毕 就不会有事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be as though she never existed.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.57,1:16:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那全是因为我们之间的友谊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that's left is our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.25,1:16:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.44,1:16:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 柯里昂太太 我们奉命不能让你过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, but we're not to let you through.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.01,1:16:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是要去市场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just going to the market.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.75,1:16:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要把单子给我们 我们会为你买回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll pick up anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.31,1:16:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁的命令？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose orders are these?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.75,1:16:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈金先生的 他正在途中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Hagen's. He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.65,1:16:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 那我得和哈金先生谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll speak to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.89,1:16:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来早要跟你解释 但我在达荷市有些事要办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to explain, but I had business in Carson City.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.76,1:16:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是顾忌你的安全 麦克的要求{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Michael's request for your safety.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.96,1:16:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以去为你买你所需要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get anything you need.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.06,1:16:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 我被软禁在我的屋里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm supposed to stay in my house?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.70,1:16:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 在整座庭园中都可以活动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, within the compound will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.16,1:16:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆 我下周要带孩子们去新英格兰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were going to New England.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.63,1:16:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,取消了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's off.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.16,1:17:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个囚犯 是不是？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I a prisoner?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.10,1:17:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是那样认为 凯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not how we see it, Kay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.60,1:17:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！孩子们 来 我们回房去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, kids. We're going back to the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.91,1:17:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.57,1:17:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,古巴！…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cuba, Cuba!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.23,1:18:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位贵宾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most respected gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.43,1:18:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎你们光临哈瓦那市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Havana.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.69,1:18:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要谢谢这批著名的 美国工业家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to thank this distinguished group of.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.74,1:18:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续和古巴一起合作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}American industrialists for continuing to work with Cuba.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.44,1:18:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她整个历史中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the greatest period of prosperity.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.53,1:19:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,最光荣的一段时代里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in her entire history.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.53,1:19:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉萧先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. William Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.88,1:19:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,代表通用食品公司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}representing the General Fruit Company.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.61,1:19:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,康德先生和唐丹先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Messrs Corngold and Dant.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.41,1:19:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,代表美国电话电报公司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of United Telephone and Telegraph Company.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.58,1:19:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,派帝先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Petty.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.18,1:19:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是泛美矿业公司的地区副总裁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}regional Vice President of the Pan American Mining Corporation.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.06,1:19:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗勃特艾伦先生 南美糖业公司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Robert Allen of South American Sugar.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.45,1:19:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克柯里昂先生 来自内华达州{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Michael Corleone of Nevada.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.62,1:19:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,代表了我们 观光休闲活动事业的联盟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}representing our associates in tourism and leisure activities.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.29,1:19:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我的老朋友及合伙人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my old friend and associate from Florida.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.36,1:19:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自佛罗里达的海门罗斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Hyman Roth.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.63,1:19:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要利用这个机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like to thank.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.60,1:19:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢美国电话电报公司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}United Telephone and Telegraph.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.00,1:19:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,所赠送的可爱的圣诞礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for their Christmas gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.17,1:19:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一座纯金的电话！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A solid gold telephone.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.94,1:20:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许各位想要看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you gentlemen would like to look at it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.17,1:20:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 总统先生 - 什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. President? - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.98,1:20:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你能谈谈叛乱的情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you discuss the rebel activity.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.87,1:20:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对于我们的 生意会有何影响？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what this can mean to our businesses?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.21,1:20:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然！- 好重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course. - Heavy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.61,1:20:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要向各位保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assure you that.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.12,1:20:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然叛乱分子在拉斯维拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lthough the rebels have started.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.98,1:20:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,掀起惊人的动乱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a campaign in Las Villas.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.65,1:20:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的参谋们告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}my staff indicates, with assurance.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.22,1:20:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能在新年之前将他们 赶出圣克拉拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we'll drive them out of Santa Clara before the New Year.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.69,1:20:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我希望你们能放心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to put you all at ease.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.36,1:20:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绝不容许游击队 出现在赌场或游泳池{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will tolerate no guerrillas in the casinos or the swimming pools.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.24,1:21:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他们在逮捕人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said that they're making an arrest.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.21,1:21:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,几分钟后会让我们通过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in a few minutes he'll let us through.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.48,1:21:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 强尼 - 没什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Johnny. - It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.75,1:21:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一群盗匪 警察在肃清他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just some lousy bandits.The police are cleaning them up.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.55,1:21:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的蛋糕来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Viva Fidel!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.99,1:21:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我的年龄没弄错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope my age is correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.10,1:21:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对我的年龄一向很确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm always accurate about my age.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.00,1:21:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在切蛋糕之前 让大家都看看蛋糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure that everybody sees the cake before we cut it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.83,1:21:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常的高兴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very pleased.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.50,1:21:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们从各地方前来 与我在这里相聚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're all able to come from such distances to be with me today.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.70,1:21:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,当一个人到了 他生命中的这一刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When a man comes to this point in his life.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.98,1:22:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他希望能将他被祝福的事 交付出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he wants to turn over the things he's been blessed with.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.61,1:22:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它们交给朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn them over to friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.57,1:22:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是给他所有的 朋友一种补偿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a reward for the friends he's had.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.78,1:22:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是要确定在他死了之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to make sure that.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.42,1:22:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切事情都还能够顺利进行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything goes well after he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.21,1:22:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还得等上很多年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for years.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.09,1:22:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会知道的 医生们不同意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see. The doctors would disagree.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.65,1:22:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们又晓得什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what do they know?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.46,1:22:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哈瓦那 所达成的美好成就{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are wonderful things that we've achieved in Havana.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.69,1:22:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,由此开始毫无止境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's no limit to where we can go from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.66,1:22:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种政府了解如何协助企业 如何去鼓励…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This kind of government knows how to help business, to encourage it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.43,1:22:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的旅馆事业 和我们在拉斯维加斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hotels here are bigger and swankier than.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.66,1:22:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何粗鄙的场所 都要更大 更豪华{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}any of the joints in Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.67,1:22:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要谢谢在古巴政府的友人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can thank our friends in the Cuban government.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.77,1:22:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,在平等的基础上 放宽了进口的限制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which has put up half the cash with the Teamsters, on a dollar for dollar basis.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.54,1:22:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且只需先付一半的现金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and has relaxed restrictions on imports.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.47,1:22:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要说的是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm saying is.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.61,1:22:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有了我们所需要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we have now what we have always needed:
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.84,1:22:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,与政府的真正合伙关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real partnership with a government.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.87,1:23:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小块一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smaller piece.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.57,1:23:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们全都认得麦克柯里昂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all know Michael Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.31,1:23:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们全都记得他的父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we all remember his father.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.51,1:23:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我退休或死亡的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the time of my retirement, or death.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.35,1:23:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把我整个哈瓦那所有的企业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I turn over all my interests in the Havana operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.82,1:23:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,全移转给他管理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to his control.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.35,1:23:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.39,1:23:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们全部都会有一份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of you will share.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.86,1:23:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳西翁雷归湖村路兄弟管理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Nacionale will go to the Lakeville Road Boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.33,1:23:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普利归柯里昂家族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Capri to the Corleone family.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.66,1:23:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞维拉毕特摩也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Sevilla Biltmore also.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.16,1:23:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但新港的艾迪拉文 将引进潘尼诺兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Eddie Levine will bring in the Pennino brothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.83,1:23:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼诺和艾迪得一部分的主权{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dino and Eddie, for a piece.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.77,1:23:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,和实际赌场经营的管理权{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to handle the casino operations.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.00,1:23:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还保留一部分 给内华达的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've saved a piece for some friends in Nevada.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.73,1:23:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,以确定家乡的事都能够顺利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make sure that things go smoothly back home.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.47,1:23:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望大家好好享用蛋糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want all of you to enjoy your cake.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.48,1:23:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…吃吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, enjoy!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.68,1:23:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,生日快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.48,1:24:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天看到一件有趣的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw an interesting thing happen today.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.21,1:24:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个叛党被宪兵逮捕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rebel was being arrested by the military police.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.55,1:24:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不但不肯被生擒 还引爆身上的手榴弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rather than be taken alive, he exploded a grenade he had in his jacket.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.18,1:24:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自杀了 还连带炸死一位指挥的队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed himself and took a captain of the command with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.62,1:24:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对吧？强尼 - 那些叛党 他们是神经病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right, Johnny? - Those rebels are lunatics.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.79,1:24:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许如此 不过这使我想到 军人是拿薪水作战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe so.But it occurred to me, that the soldiers are paidto fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.75,1:24:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛党则不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the rebels aren't.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.30,1:24:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那告诉了你什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that tell you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.66,1:24:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能会赢！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can win.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.36,1:24:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这国家过去50年来都有叛乱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This country has had rebels for 50 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.23,1:24:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的天性就是如此 相信我 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in their blood.I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.09,1:24:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我由20年代就开始来这里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been coming here since the Twenties.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.97,1:24:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你还是婴儿时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were running molasses from Havana.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.73,1:24:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就在这经营哈瓦那的糖业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you were a baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.87,1:24:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那卡车是令尊所有的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trucks were owned by your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.51,1:24:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mikey.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.21,1:24:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁愿我们单独相处时 才讨论这事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather we talked about this when we're alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.98,1:25:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那二百万一直没来到岛上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two million never got to the island.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.79,1:25:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望话传出去说 你因担心叛乱…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It mustn't be known that you held back the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.35,1:25:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不肯把钱拿出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you worried about the rebels.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.16,1:25:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down, Michael. Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.37,1:25:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我若能活到看见 和你一起达到顶峰就好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I could only live to see it, to be there with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.57,1:25:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿用一切来换取20年的寿命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I wouldn't give for 20 more years.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.54,1:25:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里被保护着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are, protected.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.14,1:25:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,能自由的争取我们的利润{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free to make our profits without Kefauver.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.51,1:25:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不被司法部及调查局打扰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the goddamn Justice Department and the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.24,1:25:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,身在90英里之外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}90 miles away.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.88,1:25:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,与友善的政府合伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in partnership with a friendly government.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.12,1:26:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许有些小事情 但不算什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}90 miles. It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.52,1:26:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,对一个想成为美国总统的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one small step for a man looking to.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.66,1:26:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是小小的一步罢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}be President of the United States.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.42,1:26:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有足够的金钱让它成为可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and having the cash to make it possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.86,1:26:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mikey!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.06,1:26:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们比美国钢铁公司还要大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're bigger than U.S. Steel.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.41,1:26:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克！你好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mikey, how are you? Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.68,1:26:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是弗雷多柯里昂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi! Freddie Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.77,1:26:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我哥哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mio frati.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.78,1:26:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷！这一路真辛苦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ, what a trip!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.08,1:26:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路上我都在想万一有人知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought, "What if somebody knows.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.25,1:27:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这里面装了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what I've got in here".
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.61,1:27:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能想像吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you imagine that?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.85,1:27:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,二百万元在飞机座位旁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two million dollars on the seat next to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.28,1:27:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 没关系的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.39,1:27:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要数数看吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to count it?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.89,1:27:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 这里究竟是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.26,1:27:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全蒙在鼓里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm totally in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.50,1:27:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,家族在哈瓦那要进行投资{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The family is making an investment in Havana.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.67,1:27:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是给总统的礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a gift for the President.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.07,1:27:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那太好了 哈瓦那好极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great! Havana's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.24,1:27:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我这种人的城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my kind of town.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.57,1:27:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我认识的人在哈瓦那吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody I know in Havana?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.68,1:27:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 有海门罗斯 强尼欧拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know. Hyman Roth, Johnny Ola?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.35,1:27:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不认得 我从未见过他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I've never met them.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.65,1:27:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 麦克 我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Mikey, I'm kind of…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.22,1:27:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…kind of.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.55,1:28:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一路上让我有点紧张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}nervous from the trip.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.25,1:28:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能…喝杯酒吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get a drink or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.72,1:28:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想也许我们可以一起出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought maybe we'd go out together.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.95,1:28:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道一个好地方 好不好？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a place where we can spend some time together.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.56,1:28:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候我想我应该娶 像你老婆一样的女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I think I should have married a woman like you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.76,1:28:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,像凯 有孩子 能和他们一起玩耍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Kay.Have kids. Have a family.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.31,1:28:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我生命中能有一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For once in my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.77,1:28:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能够像爸爸那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}be more like Pop…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.97,1:28:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,当个儿子并不容易 弗雷多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not easy to be a son, Fredo.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.10,1:28:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不容易的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.74,1:28:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈以前常取笑我说 「你不是我生的」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama used to say, "You don't belong to me."
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.11,1:28:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是吉普赛人留在门口的 有时候我认为那是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You were left on the doorstep by gypsies."Sometimes I think it's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.75,1:28:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是吉普赛人留下的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're no gypsy, Fredo.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.22,1:28:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mikey… I…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.19,1:28:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前生你的气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was mad at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.83,1:29:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何从前我们不曾 像这样一起共聚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't we spend time like this before?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.56,1:29:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要喝一杯 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a drink, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.42,1:29:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,侍者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiter!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.66,1:29:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,香蕉大克利酒怎么讲？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you say Banana Daquiri?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.37,1:29:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是香蕉大克利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banana Daquiri.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.79,1:29:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就那样？- 就那样！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it? - That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.17,1:29:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,来一杯香蕉大克利酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uno Banana Daquiri.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.07,1:29:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,香蕉大克利酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banana Daquiri.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.40,1:29:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一杯苏打汽水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a club soda.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.57,1:29:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛瑞参议员明晚由华府飞来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator Geary flies in from Washington tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.21,1:29:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一些人 一些政府要员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with some government people.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.68,1:29:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你让他们 在哈瓦那好好玩玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to show them a good time in Havana.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.28,1:29:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的专长！对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my speciality, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.81,1:29:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能在某些事上信任你吗？弗雷多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I trust you with something?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.11,1:29:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然！麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.62,1:30:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上我们将应邀至总统府 参加除夕晚会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later in the evening we're all invited to the President to bring in the New Year.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.79,1:30:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束之后 他们会用军车载我回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After it's over they'll take me home in a military car.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.65,1:30:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我一个人 为了保护我的安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}alone.For my protection.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.29,1:30:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我到达旅馆之前 我会被刺杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I reach my hotel, I'll be assassinated.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.01,1:30:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是谁？- 罗斯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - Roth.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.78,1:30:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是罗斯想在家里杀我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Roth who tried to kill me in my home.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.52,1:30:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都是罗斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Roth all along.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.98,1:30:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他表现的好像我是他的儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He acts like I'm his son.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.02,1:30:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的接班人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}his successor.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.95,1:30:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他认为他能长生不死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he thinks he'll live forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.75,1:30:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要除掉我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wants me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.03,1:31:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能怎么帮忙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I help?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.56,1:31:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只须装作什么都不知道 我已经做了安排{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go along, as if you know nothing.I've already made my move.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.63,1:31:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么安排？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What move?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.73,1:31:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,海门罗斯永远见不到这个新年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hyman Roth won't see the New Year.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.61,1:31:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说你要放轻松点 他会开处方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says you have to take it easy.And he's gonna give you a prescription.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.41,1:31:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他明天会再来 - 我要我自己的医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He'll be back tomorrow. - I want my own doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.78,1:31:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他从迈阿密飞过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fly in my own doctor from Miami.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.21,1:31:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别信任不会说英文的医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't trust a doctor who can't speak English.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.01,1:31:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 先生 - 不必客气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gracias, senor - Buenas noches.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.78,1:31:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 到下面赌场去玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, go to the casino.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.81,1:31:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你确定你感觉好多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're feeling better.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.51,1:31:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.06,1:31:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,去玩宾果游戏吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play the bingo game.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.86,1:31:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 幸会 柯里昂先生 请自便 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. Nice to see you, Mr. Paul. Just make yourself home. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.73,1:32:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的第六感告诉我 你哥哥弗雷多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sixth sense tells me Fredo.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.73,1:32:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,带来了一大袋钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}brought a bag full of money.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.90,1:32:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.33,1:32:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要退出？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pulling out?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.73,1:32:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是想要…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just want to…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.43,1:32:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是想要等一等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just want to wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.30,1:32:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你感觉如何？- 糟透了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you feel? - Terrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.10,1:32:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要小便时不会痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd give four million to be able.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.24,1:32:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意付四百万美金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take a painless piss.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.30,1:32:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁杀了法兰克潘坦居利？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who had Frank Pentangeli killed?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.71,1:32:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是罗萨多兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Rosato brothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.24,1:32:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但是谁准他们动手的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, but who gave the go-ahead?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.25,1:32:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道不是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.92,1:32:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个从小和我一起长大的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was this kid I grew up with.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.95,1:32:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我年轻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was younger than me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.92,1:32:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他蛮尊敬我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of looked up to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.53,1:32:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.23,1:32:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起做了我们的第一件工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did our first work together.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.59,1:32:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在街头打下了一片江山{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worked our way out of the street.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.49,1:33:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情很顺利 我们也赚了很多钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things were good.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.59,1:33:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在禁酒时期 我们把蜜糖 运到加拿大发了笔大财{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}During Prohibition we ran molasses into Canada.Made a fortune.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.73,1:33:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,令尊也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father too.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.27,1:33:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如同其他人一样 我爱他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As much as anyone, I loved him and.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.97,1:33:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且信任他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}trusted him.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.88,1:33:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久之后 他有个主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later on he had an idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.61,1:33:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在沙漠建了一座城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to build a city.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.91,1:33:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,给要去西岸的军人休息之用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of a desert stop-over for G.I.s going to the West Coast.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.58,1:33:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子的名字是莫格林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kid's name was Moe Greene.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.31,1:33:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他所创建的城市是拉斯维加斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the city he invented was Las Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.42,1:33:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个了不起的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was a great man.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.09,1:33:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个有眼光 有胆量的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man of vision and guts.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.59,1:33:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而在那城市中 没有任何纪念他的徽章或路标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there isn't even a plaque, signpost.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.19,1:33:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是他的铜像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or statue of him in that town.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.76,1:33:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,原因是有人用子弹 穿过他的眉心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone put a bullet through his eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.76,1:34:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人晓得是谁下的命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one knows who gave the order.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.07,1:34:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我听到他的死讯时 我没有生气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I heard it, I wasn't angry.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.37,1:34:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解莫 我知道他脾气火爆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew Moe, I knew he was headstrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.57,1:34:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话大声 会得罪人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talking loud, saying stupid things.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.30,1:34:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when he turned up dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.64,1:34:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不去追究{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let it go.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.04,1:34:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对我自己说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I said to myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.24,1:34:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们自己选择的行业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the business we've chosen.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.41,1:34:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.28,1:34:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁下的令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who gave the order.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.25,1:34:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那和生意一点关系也没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it had nothing to do with business.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.89,1:34:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你房间里的二百万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That two million in a bag in your room.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.65,1:34:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要进去睡一会儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going in to take a nap.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.82,1:34:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我醒来时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I wake.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.19,1:34:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是钱在桌子上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if the money is on the table.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.69,1:34:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就有个合伙人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I have a partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.83,1:35:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,若不在 我就知道我没有了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it isn't, I know I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.90,1:35:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 在座的是否都认识？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does everybody know everybody?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.76,1:36:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是葛瑞参议员 你认识他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is senator Geary, you know him.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.40,1:36:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好吗？先生 - 幸会 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How are you, senator? - Good to see you, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.34,1:36:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴能在这里共聚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad we spend this time together.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.14,1:36:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克！这位是佛州的派顿参议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator Payton from Florida.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.30,1:36:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How ya doin', Mike?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.43,1:36:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约的迪马克法官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judge DeMalco from New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.10,1:36:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好吗？先生 - 很好！谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you do, Sir? - Fine, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.97,1:36:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是马里兰州的瑞恩参议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator Ream from Maryland.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.18,1:36:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 我一直期待与你见面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, I've been looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.88,1:36:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国电话电报公司的康德先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fred Corngold from UTT.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.47,1:36:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认得康德 你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know Fred, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.57,1:36:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的恰恰跳得很棒 待会可要留神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Freddie does a mean Cha Cha Cha so watch out later.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.11,1:36:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh he does, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.18,1:36:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 各位！是「加油时间」了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, gentlemen, it's refill time here.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.71,1:36:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也许该试试本地的酒类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might try some of those local drinks,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.98,1:36:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗？像是「古巴自由」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know "Cuba Libra"
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.18,1:36:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,「克拉达先生」之类的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Pi?a Colada"
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.55,1:36:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要试试那…黑头发的妞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'll try one of those red headed Yolandas.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.28,1:36:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那没问题！你有了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you got! Con gusto…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.65,1:36:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.25,1:36:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不认识家兄弗雷多 对不对？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know my brother Fredo.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.28,1:36:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼欧拉 弗雷多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny Ola, Fredo.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.15,1:36:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从未见过 我是强尼欧拉 幸会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never met. Johnny Ola. Pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.86,1:36:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位！敬在哈瓦那的一夜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, to a night in Havana!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.46,1:36:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 新年快乐！- 新年快乐！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Happy New Year! - Happy New Year!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.36,1:36:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 新年快乐 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Feliz Ano Nuevo! - Happy New Year.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.80,1:37:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里 就在那里 别怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's there, it's there. Don't afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.97,1:37:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷多！我们干嘛站着？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Freddie, why are we standing?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.37,1:37:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都站着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody stands.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.87,1:37:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这值得的 你看 你不会相信这个的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worth it. You won't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.10,1:37:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经开始不相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it already.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.80,1:37:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌50元 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}50 dollars, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.01,1:37:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌了！参议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a bet, mister.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.11,1:37:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他！那就是超人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Superman.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.90,1:38:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了吧？我说过了吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I tell you or did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.54,1:38:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.13,1:38:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西一定是假的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be fake.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.34,1:38:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是假的 那是真的 所以才叫他超人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's real. That's why he's called Superman.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.30,1:38:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷多！…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.47,1:38:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么找到这地方的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where did you find this place?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.31,1:38:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼欧拉告诉我这地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny Ola brought me here.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.11,1:38:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他带我来这的 我并不相信他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.47,1:38:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但眼见为凭 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but seeing is believing!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.41,1:38:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了但依然不相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see it, but still don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.01,1:38:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,派顿 50块钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}50 bucks, Pat.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.28,1:38:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯老头从来不到这里来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roth won't go here.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.81,1:38:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但强尼对这地方是瞭如指掌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Johnny knows these places like the back of his hand.!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.95,1:38:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意看！他要把那打碎了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now watch him, he's gonna break a cracked with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.01,1:38:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,打碎那个？我要看他打断一座桥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break a cracker? I want to see him break a brick.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.35,1:38:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可以打到月亮上！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could knock down a building.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.93,1:39:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松点！罗斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax!Se?or Roth.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.27,1:39:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们立刻送你到医院去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're taking you to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.36,1:40:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,依我的判断你能继续你的目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in my judgment, you'll continue to get those,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.80,1:40:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I don't believe.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.13,1:40:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾森豪总统会撤出古巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that President Eisenhower well ever pull out of Cuba.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.24,1:40:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们在古巴 有超过十亿美金的投资{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not as long as we have over one billion dollars.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.57,1:40:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就不会撤走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}invested in this country.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.34,1:41:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国相信不干涉政策…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The American public believe in non-intervention…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.74,1:41:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fredo!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.41,1:41:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.78,1:41:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去倒杯真正的酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting a real drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.25,1:41:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这个会要了我的命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I can't…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.21,1:42:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯先生怎么还不来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kept Mr. Roth?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.58,1:42:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他要来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understood he was coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.61,1:42:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,外交礼节是怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reeves, what's the protocol?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.85,1:42:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要在这停留多久？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long should we stay?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.35,1:42:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't konw.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.65,1:42:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想半个小时就可以了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think a half hour ought to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.48,1:42:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要等到新年来临即可{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just long enough to bring in the New Year.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.43,1:42:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是除夕夜 来吧！一分钟就好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's New Year's Eve. Come on, just for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.14,1:43:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有架飞机在等我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a plane waiting.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.75,1:43:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小时内带我们到迈阿密 知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take us to Miami in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.54,1:43:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要把它看得太严重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make a big thing about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.57,1:44:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道是你！弗雷多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it was you, Fredo.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.01,1:44:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你伤了我的心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You broke my heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.01,1:44:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你伤了我的心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You broke my heart!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.81,1:44:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,鉴于我们的部队在关达那摩 及圣地牙哥严重的挫败{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Due to serious setbacks to our troops in Guantanamo and Santiago.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.41,1:44:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在古巴的地位已经动摇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}my position in Cuba is untenable.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.68,1:45:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为避免更多的流血战争 我将辞去总统职位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am resigning from office to avoid further bloodshed.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.35,1:45:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我会立刻离开这座城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I shall leave the city immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.16,1:45:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祝你们好运！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish all of you good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.31,1:45:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷多！来吧！跟我一起走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fredo!Come on. Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.85,1:45:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是今晚离开这的唯一方法！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way out of here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.18,1:46:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯已经死了！弗雷多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roth is dead!Fredo.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.85,1:46:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷多！跟我一起走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fredo, come with me!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.62,1:46:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仍然是我哥哥！弗雷多…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still my brother.Fredo…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.23,1:46:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有美国公民才行！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Passports, Passports, U.S. passports only, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.53,1:46:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们过去！我是美国参议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pass through, I'm Pat GEARY of the United States Senate!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.84,1:46:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请退后！- 拜托 等一下 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get back! - Please, I must leave!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.51,1:47:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾尔！给我一条湿毛巾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Al. Get me a wet towel.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.52,1:48:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯知道我回来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does Kay know I'm back?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.32,1:48:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩子呢？圣诞节有送东西给他们吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My boy? Did you get him something for Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.66,1:48:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我料理了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took care of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.33,1:48:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,送的是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it, so I'll know.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.13,1:48:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是辆有电动马达的小车 他能驾驶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a little car with an electric motor that he can ride in.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.70,1:48:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.94,1:48:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 艾尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Al.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.80,1:48:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾尔 你们是否能出去一会儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fellows, could you step outside for a minute?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.35,1:48:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my brother?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.11,1:48:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯坐私人船回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roth got out on a private boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.52,1:48:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在迈阿密医院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in a hospital in Miami.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.68,1:48:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,心脏病发作过一次 但复元情况良好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a stroke, but recovered okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.41,1:48:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的侍卫死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your bodyguard is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.28,1:48:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在问弗雷多的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked about Fredo.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.02,1:49:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他逃出来了 一定在纽约某处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he got out. He must be somewhere in New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.42,1:49:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.09,1:49:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你和他连络{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to get in touch with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.06,1:49:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我晓得他害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know he's scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.76,1:49:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但告诉他一切都没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him everything is all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.03,1:49:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道是罗斯唆使他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him I know Roth misled him.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.39,1:49:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他并不知道他们想杀我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he didn't know they would try to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.56,1:49:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他们进来吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can come in now.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.90,1:49:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 还有别的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.57,1:49:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.87,1:49:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧！什么事？快说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.60,1:49:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯小产了！孩子没保住！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay had a miscarriage.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.88,1:49:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个男孩吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it a boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.16,1:49:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 才三个半月大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At three and a half months.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.52,1:49:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能直接了当给我答案吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you give me a straight answer?!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.49,1:49:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个男孩吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it a boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.52,1:50:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.26,1:50:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的小弗雷多 他得了肺炎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor little Fredo, he's got pneumonia.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.36,1:51:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻人 我听说你 及你的朋友们在偷东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young man, I hear you and your friends are stealing goods.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.79,1:51:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们连套衣服 也没送到我家去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't even send a dress to my house.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.50,1:51:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不尊重我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No respect!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.13,1:51:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我有三个女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I've got three daughters.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.70,1:51:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的地盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.67,1:51:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你与你的朋友们 应该对我尊敬些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your friends should show me some respect.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.54,1:51:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该分我一份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should let me wet my beak a little.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.57,1:51:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你与你的朋友们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you and your friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.01,1:51:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,每人分得了六百元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}cleared $600 each.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.15,1:51:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你们的安全 每人给我二百元保护费{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me $200 each, for your own protection.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.98,1:51:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就忘了这侮辱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll forget the insult.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.31,1:51:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们年轻的混蛋该学习{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You young punks have to learn.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.19,1:51:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊重像我这一类的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to respect a man like me!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.03,1:51:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则条子会到你们家去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise the cops will come to your house.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.26,1:52:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们的家就被毁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your family will be ruined.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.32,1:52:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 若是我弄错了 你们行窃的金额{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course if I'm wrong about how much you stole.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.06,1:52:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以少收一点 每人少收一百元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take a little less.And by less, I only mean a hundred bucks less.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.87,1:52:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拒绝我 了解吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now don't refuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.63,1:52:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 了解吗？同乡 - 我了解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Understand, paesano? - I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.87,1:52:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我与我的朋友们把钱全分了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friends and I share all the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.91,1:52:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我得先和他们谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So first, I have to talk to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.38,1:52:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,去和你的朋友们谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell your friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.85,1:52:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要的不多 分一份而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want a lot. Just enough to wet my beak.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.71,1:52:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怕告诉他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be afraid to tell them!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.55,1:52:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,六百元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}600 bucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.89,1:52:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是我们不付呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suppose we don't pay?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.92,1:52:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们那帮人 泰西欧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know his gang, Tessio.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.32,1:52:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的野兽！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real animals.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.98,1:52:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,马朗萨拉让范伦奇在这一带混{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maranzalla himself let Fanucci work this neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.26,1:52:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他与条子有来往！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got connections with the cops, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.76,1:52:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须付给他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to pay him.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.46,1:53:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,每人二百元 大家同意吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}$200 each…everybody agreed?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.53,1:53:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们干嘛得付给他？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do we have to pay him?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.16,1:53:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多 这件事交给我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vito, leave this to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.96,1:53:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只有一个人 我们有三个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one person, we're three.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.77,1:53:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有枪 我们也有枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got guns, we've got guns.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.07,1:53:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何要将我们的血汗钱送给他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should we give him the money we sweated for?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.30,1:53:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是他的地盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is his neighborhood!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.47,1:53:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识两个不付钱给范伦奇的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know two bookies who don't give anything to Fanucci.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.68,1:53:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不付钱给范伦奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't pay Fanucci.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.28,1:53:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,若他们不付钱给范伦奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they don't pay Fanucci.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.95,1:53:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是另外有人为马朗萨拉去收{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then somebody else collects for Maranzalla!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.98,1:53:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们若付他钱 他就不会再缠我们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll all be better off if we pay him.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.42,1:53:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.73,1:54:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在说的仅止于这个房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what I say stays in this room.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.33,1:54:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是你们俩愿意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you both like.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.34,1:54:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何不每人给我50元付范伦奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}why not give me $50 each to pay Fanucci?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.47,1:54:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证他会接受我付给他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guarantee he'll accept what I give him.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.94,1:54:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是范伦奇说二百元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Fanucci says $200.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.84,1:54:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是要那么多 维多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he means it, Vito!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.84,1:54:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会和他讲道理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll reason with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.31,1:54:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把事情交给我吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.45,1:54:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会料理一切的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.48,1:54:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不对我的朋友说谎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never lie to my friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.56,1:54:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天你们俩都去和范伦奇谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow you both go talk to Fanucci.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.35,1:54:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会要那笔钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll ask for the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.65,1:54:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他你们会如数奉上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him you'll pay whatever he wants.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.46,1:54:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别和他争论{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't argue with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.26,1:54:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我会去让他同意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll go and get him to agree.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.06,1:55:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然他那么强硬 别和他争论{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't argue with him, since he's so tough.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.16,1:55:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么可能让他少拿点？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you get him to take less?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.90,1:55:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my business.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.50,1:55:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要记得我帮了你们一个忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just remember that I did you a favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.34,1:55:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一言为定？- 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it a deal? - Si.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.88,1:55:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salute.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.68,1:55:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salute.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.80,1:56:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的家人出去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His family's out of the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.44,1:56:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,范伦奇一个人在咖啡厅里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fanucci's alone in the cafe.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.64,1:56:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多 这是我的50元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vito, here's my 50 dollars.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.22,1:56:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多！你确定他会收吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buona fortuna, are you sure he's going to go for it?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.48,1:56:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让范伦奇不能拒绝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make an offer he don't refuse.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.49,1:56:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.75,1:57:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来我帽子下有一百元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like there's $100 under my hat.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.62,1:57:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说对了 只有一百元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was right.Only $100…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.99,1:57:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我目前缺钱用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm short of money right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.93,1:57:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失业了 给我一点时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been out of work, so just give me a little time.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.43,1:57:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你了解的 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.36,1:58:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有胆量年轻人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got balls, young man!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.97,1:58:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前为何没听到你的名字？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come I never heard of you before?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.45,1:58:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你非常有胆量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a lot of guts.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:20.92,1:58:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你找份赚大钱的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find you some work for good money.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.99,1:58:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不伤感情 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No hard feelings, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.13,1:58:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我能帮你 让我晓得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can help you, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.13,1:58:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你佳节愉快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy the festa!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.91,1:59:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,范伦奇阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don FANUCCI.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.70,2:00:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forzzelando!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.87,2:01:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对我来说太暴力了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is too violent for me!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.80,2:03:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What've you got there?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.69,2:06:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 爸爸非常的爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael, your father loves you very much.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.32,2:09:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇契先生 从1942年到现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Cicci, from the year 1942 to the present time,
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.95,2:09:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是杰安可橄榄油公司的职员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were an employee of the Genco Olive Oil Company?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:41.41,2:09:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:43.94,2:09:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但事实上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in actuality.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:45.14,2:09:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是柯里昂犯罪组织的成员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were a member of the Corleone crime organisation.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:51.01,2:09:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们叫做柯里昂家族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we called it the Corleone family,
Dialogue: 0,2:09:53.80,2:09:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,参议员 我们称之为家族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator.we called it the family.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:55.40,2:09:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的职务是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was your position?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:58.63,2:10:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,起初跟其他人一样 只是个打手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At first, like everybody else, I was a soldier.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:01.92,2:10:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:03.06,2:10:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一颗枪子儿 你知道是什么 参议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A button, you know, Senator.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:05.06,2:10:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不知道 告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't know. Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:09.12,2:10:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,当老板说给某人一颗枪子儿时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the boss says "push a button" on a guy,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:11.86,2:10:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就给他一颗枪子儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I push a button.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:13.36,2:10:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？参议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, Senator?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:14.72,2:10:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎斯特先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Questadt.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:16.51,2:10:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是说你杀人 - 我什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mean you kill people? - I what?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:19.05,2:10:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你服从上级的命令去杀人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kill people at the behest of your superiors.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:27.68,2:10:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错！大律师！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:29.30,2:10:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你们家族的 老大是麦克柯里昂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the head of your family is Michael Corleone?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:34.73,2:10:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 大律师 麦克柯里昂 对了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Counsellor. Michael Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:37.93,2:10:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否有直接收到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever get such an order.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:39.53,2:10:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克柯里昂下的命令？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}directly from Michael Corleone?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.49,2:10:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我从来没和他说过话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I never talked to him.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:44.69,2:10:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇契先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Cicci.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:46.38,2:10:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否能详细说明你的答案？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you amplify your answer a bit?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:49.08,2:10:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:50.65,2:10:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否能回答得更详细{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you expand on your answer?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:52.91,2:10:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是是否你跟上级之间 永远有中间人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm particularly interested in knowing, was there always a buffer involved?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:58.11,2:11:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你和发出实际命令的 上级间的中间人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone in between you and your superiors who gave the order.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:02.94,2:11:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 对的 中间人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, a buffer.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:04.94,2:11:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,家族中有许多的中间人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The family had a lot of buffers!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:08.61,2:11:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇契先生 你也许觉得这很好玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may find this very amusing,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:10.64,2:11:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我告诉你 委员会的成员不这么想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the members of this committee do not.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:48.09,2:11:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 妈 在父亲内心深处 他想些什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me something, Ma.What did Papa think deep in his heart?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:57.92,2:12:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以前很坚强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was being strong.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:03.09,2:12:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为他的家庭而坚强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strong for his family.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:12.07,2:12:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是为他的家坚强以外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But by being strong for his family.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:22.11,2:12:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会不会失去它？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}could he lose it?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:28.97,2:12:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在想你太太及失去的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're thinking about your wife about the baby you lost.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:32.44,2:12:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你与你太太都还能再生孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you and your wife can always have another baby.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:40.75,2:12:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是说…失去他的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I meant… lose his family,
Dialogue: 0,2:12:47.55,2:12:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你永远不会失去你的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can never lose your family.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:00.42,2:13:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,时代变了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Times are changing.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:24.50,2:13:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是我的荣幸 不要钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my pleasure. I don't want money.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.04,2:13:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把它当礼物吧！- 谢谢 非常谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take it as a gift. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:31.63,2:13:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有什么我可以帮忙的 你来 我们谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's something I can do for you, you come, we talk.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:37.30,2:13:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grazie.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:53.08,2:13:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯伦波太太 你找我有什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signora Colombo, why did you come to see me?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:59.25,2:14:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太太叫我来问你是否能帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife told me to ask if you could help me.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:05.52,2:14:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有大麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's in bad trouble.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:08.22,2:14:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的邻居向房东抱怨她的狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her neighbors complained to the landlord about her dog.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:13.55,2:14:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫她把动物丢掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told her to get rid of the animal.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:16.52,2:14:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她的小儿子爱那条狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But her little boy loves that dog.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:20.06,2:14:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以她留下了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she hid it.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:22.63,2:14:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当房东发现之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the landlord found out.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:25.19,2:14:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很生气 叫她搬走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he got mad and told her to leave.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:27.23,2:14:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在即使她把狗送走 也无法住下去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now she can't stay even if she gets rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:32.37,2:14:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好惭愧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so ashamed!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:34.64,2:14:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说要叫警察把我们扔到街上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he'd get the police to throw us out on the street.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:41.84,2:14:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 但…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:46.07,2:14:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能给你一些钱帮你搬家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could give you a couple dollars to help you move.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:49.84,2:14:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能搬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:52.41,2:14:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你和他谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to talk to him!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:55.14,2:14:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他我希望住在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him I want to stay here!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:05.64,2:15:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的房东叫什么名字？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your landlord's name?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:07.48,2:15:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是罗勃特先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Signor Roberto.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:10.12,2:15:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他住在第四街 离这很近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lives on Fourth Street, near here.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:13.28,2:15:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们打破窗户 弄脏地板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They break the windows, they dirty the floors…
Dialogue: 0,2:15:17.02,2:15:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是猪 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A real pig-sty, eh?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:31.23,2:15:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗勃特先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr.Roberto.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:36.60,2:15:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是维多柯里昂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Vito Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:39.56,2:15:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯伦波太太是内人的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signora Colombo is a friend of my wife.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:42.97,2:15:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说没有正当理由 就要赶她搬家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says she's been evicted for no good reason.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:46.94,2:15:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个穷寡妇 没人照料她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a poor widow, she has nobody to take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:50.90,2:15:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没有亲人 没有钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has no relatives, no money.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:54.14,2:15:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她所有的只是这一带的邻居{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All she has is this neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:55.70,2:15:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经把那地方租给别人家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already rented the place to another family.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:03.60,2:16:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过她我会和你谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told her that I'd talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:06.97,2:16:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你是个讲道理的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you're a reasonable man.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:10.88,2:16:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经弄走惹麻烦的狗了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got rid of the animal that caused all the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:14.88,2:16:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她留下来吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let her stay.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:19.78,2:16:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是不是西西里人？- 不 我是卡拉布列兹人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you Sicilian? - No, I'm Calabrese.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:23.72,2:16:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们实际上是同乡 帮我一个忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're practically paesani, do me this favor.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:27.42,2:16:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经租出去了 反悔的话 我会看起来像个白痴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already rented it! I'll look like an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:32.39,2:16:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且新房客的房租要高一些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, the new tenants pay more rent.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:34.29,2:16:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个月多少钱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much more a month?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:37.09,2:16:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,五块钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five bucks.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:43.73,2:16:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是先付六个月的涨价租金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's six months increase in advance.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:46.46,2:16:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但别告诉她 她的自尊心很强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't tell her about it. She's very proud.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:50.69,2:16:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个月到了再来找我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come see me in another six months.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:55.16,2:16:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 那条狗留下 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, the dog stays. Right?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:59.00,2:17:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条狗留下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dog stays.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:00.53,2:17:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你算什么？来对我下命令？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you to come give me orders?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:08.31,2:17:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心我把你那 西西里屁股踢上街{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out or I'll kick your Sicilian ass right into the street!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:14.81,2:17:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我一个忙 我不会忘记的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do me this favor.I won't forget it.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:20.57,2:17:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,向你这一带的朋友打听我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask your friends in the neighborhood about me.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:24.91,2:17:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会告诉你 我会回报的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll tell you I know how to return a favor.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:34.15,2:17:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好一个厉害的傢伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a character!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:43.15,2:17:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多 那个叫罗勃特的房东来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That landlord is here… Roberto.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:46.53,2:17:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,专门出租房子那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one who owns those ratholes.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:57.29,2:18:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这一带一直打听你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been asking all around the neighborhood about you.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:03.26,2:18:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grazie.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:07.33,2:18:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我没打扰你 维多阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope I'm not disturbing you, Don Vito.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:11.97,2:18:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何效劳之处？罗勃阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do for you, Don Roberto?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:15.20,2:18:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是场误会！圣母玛丽亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a misunderstanding! Holy Mary!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:19.44,2:18:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯伦波太太当然能留下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course Signora Colombo can stay!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:25.34,2:18:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢！…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grazie…
Dialogue: 0,2:18:27.44,2:18:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多阁下 我要把你给我的钱还你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm giving back the money you gave me.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:33.51,2:18:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三 四 五 六 全都在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Un, due, three, four, five, six, tutt'!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:39.98,2:18:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多阁下 毕竟钱非一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because after all, Don Vito, money isn't everything.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:53.39,2:18:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能坐下吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I sit down?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:56.32,2:18:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grazie.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:57.98,2:19:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对寡妇的仁慈令我自己惭愧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your kindness to that widow made me ashamed of myself.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:01.83,2:19:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,房租和以前一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rent stays like before!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:13.23,2:19:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且…我会降价{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll even lower it.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:19.19,2:19:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我减五元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll lower it $5.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:24.60,2:19:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我减十元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll lower it $10!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:26.83,2:19:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grazie…
Dialogue: 0,2:19:30.91,2:19:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能请你喝咖啡吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I offer you some coffee?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:35.20,2:19:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我约会快迟到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm late for an appointment!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:40.74,2:19:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一次不行 也许改天吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't this time! Ask me another time!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:44.98,2:19:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,请原谅我现在失陪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to excuse me for now.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:52.28,2:20:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我能留久一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could stay longer!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:00.68,2:20:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要叫我 我就会来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just call me and I'll be here!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:07.16,2:20:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grazie.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:15.95,2:20:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会回来了 他会躲起来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't be back. He'll hide out in the Bronx!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:34.80,2:20:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多 你认为如何？天佑美国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vito, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:37.40,2:20:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会鸿图大展的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll make a big business!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:46.91,2:20:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 纽约市 - 不介意大声点吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- New York City. - We'll make a big business!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:50.31,2:20:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}New York City.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:52.11,2:20:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是否为维多柯里昂之子 - 是的 我是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you the son of Vito Corleone? - Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:55.91,2:20:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪诞生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where was he born?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:57.67,2:20:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,西西里的柯里昂村{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corleone, Sicily.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:59.45,2:21:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是否有时会使用别号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he at times use an alias.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:01.75,2:21:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是别人所说的「教父」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was known in certain circles as Godfather?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:06.31,2:21:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,教父是他朋友对他的称呼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godfather is a term used by his friends.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:09.88,2:21:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是种内心的感受与对他的尊敬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of affection and respect.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:13.12,2:21:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,主席先生！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Chairman.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:14.49,2:21:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想证实证人的陈词{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like to verify the witness' statement.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:17.85,2:21:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年来我的选民中 意大利人后裔不断增加{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For years many of my constituents have been of Italian descent.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:23.13,2:21:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我蛮了解他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've come to know them well.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:25.83,2:21:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以支持及友谊来荣耀我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have honoured me with their support and their friendship.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:30.22,2:21:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以很骄傲的说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can proudly say.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:31.69,2:21:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的一些要好的朋友中 有不少是美籍意大利人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that some of my very best friends are Italian-Americans.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:36.59,2:21:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,主席先生 在这个重要时刻 我必须离席{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, Mr. Chairman, unfortunately I have to leave these proceedings.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:41.76,2:21:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,去参加我的委员会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in order to preside over a very important meeting.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:44.56,2:21:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,主持一个极重要的会议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of my own committee.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:46.80,2:21:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在我离开之前 我要说明这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I leave, I do want to say this.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:50.17,2:21:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次关于黑手党的听证会 不管怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that these hearings on the Mafia are in no way whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:54.67,2:21:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,都对意大利人是一种侮辱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a slur upon the great Italian people.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:57.30,2:22:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为根据我自己的 经验与知识我可以断定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can state from my own knowledge and experience.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:00.60,2:22:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国公民中 最忠贞爱国苦干的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Italian-Americans are among the most loyal, most law-abiding,
Dialogue: 0,2:22:05.84,2:22:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,美籍意大利人是其中的一分子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}patriotic, hard-working American citizens in this land.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:10.38,2:22:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我们让一粒老鼠屎 坏了一锅粥的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be a shame, Mr. Chairman.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:15.45,2:22:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会是很可惜的 主席先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we allowed a few rotten apples to give a bad nameto the whole barrel.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:18.11,2:22:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为由历史上 伟大的哥伦布时代开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ecause from the time of Christopher Columbus.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:20.88,2:22:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过了文艺复兴直到目前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the time of Enrico Fermi.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:23.56,2:22:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,美籍意大利人一直是我们国家的 前锋与护卫者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Italian-Americans have been pioneers in building and defending our nation.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:30.55,2:22:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是土地之盐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are the salt of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:32.42,2:22:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是这国家的支柱之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one of the backbones of this country.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:38.32,2:22:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here,
Dialogue: 0,2:22:39.46,2:22:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here…
Dialogue: 0,2:22:41.79,2:22:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想大家都同意我们同僚的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we all agree with our esteemed college.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:45.56,2:22:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Mr. Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:46.72,2:22:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经被知会了你的法律权益{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have been advised as to your legal rights.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:50.06,2:22:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有一位证人的证词{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have testimony.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:52.09,2:22:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位之前的证人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a previous witness.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:53.36,2:22:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇契先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}one Willi Cicci.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:56.56,2:22:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他作证说你是这国家中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stated hat you are head of.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:58.00,2:23:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,最有威力的黑手党家族的老大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most powerful Mafia family in the country.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:01.00,2:23:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是吗？- 不 我不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you? - No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:03.40,2:23:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,证人指证你要对1947年 纽约市警官的谋杀案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He testified that you are personally responsible.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:06.93,2:23:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,及与他一起被杀的 威尔斯索拉索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the murder of a New York police captain in 1947.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:12.30,2:23:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,负完全的责任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and with him a man named Virgil Sollozzo.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:14.51,2:23:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你否认吗？- 是的 我否认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you deny this? - Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:17.14,2:23:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,1950年时你是否策划杀害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true that in the year 1950 you devised the murder.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:22.35,2:23:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所谓纽约市五大家族的老大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the heads of the "Five Families" in New York.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:26.01,2:23:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,以稳固你独霸的情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who assume and consolidate your nefarious power?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:29.69,2:23:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这完全是假的 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a complete falsehood.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:31.95,2:23:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎斯特先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Questadt.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:33.22,2:23:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否拥有 拉斯维加斯三间主要旅馆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true you have a controlling interest in three major hotels in Las Vegas?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:38.72,2:23:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是真的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not true.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:39.95,2:23:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拥有一些那里旅馆的股票{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I own some stock in some of the hotels there.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:42.65,2:23:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但数量很少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but very little.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:46.76,2:23:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有IBM 及电话电报公司的部分股票{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also have stock in IBM and IT&T.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:51.05,2:23:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:52.19,2:23:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否控制了纽约州的 赌场及毒品市场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Corleone do you have any interests or control over gambling or narcotics…
Dialogue: 0,2:23:56.49,2:23:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或是有那个兴趣 - 不 我没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- in the state of New York? - No, I do not.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:59.83,2:24:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,参议员 我的委托人想要…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator, my client would like.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:02.42,2:24:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这委员会面前发表一篇声明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to read a statement.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:03.63,2:24:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,主席先生！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Chairman.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:04.83,2:24:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,主席先生！我认为这篇声明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Chairman, I think this statement is.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:07.20,2:24:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,以目前来说是完全不合时宜的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}totally out of order at this time.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:09.40,2:24:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我的委托人 很诚心诚意的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, my client has answered.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:12.44,2:24:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答了这委员会每一个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this committee's questions with sincerity.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:13.70,2:24:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他虽有权引用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hasn't taken.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:17.27,2:24:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他并没有用 宪法第五修正案来回避{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Fifth Amendment.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:18.81,2:24:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了公平起见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so this statement.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:20.14,2:24:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为这篇声明该被听到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}should be heard!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:23.21,2:24:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我允许柯里昂先生 读出他的声明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'll allow Mr. Corleone to read his statement.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:26.71,2:24:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把它列入记录{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll put it in the record.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:30.01,2:24:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了希望澄清我家庭的名声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the hopes of clearing my family name.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:33.04,2:24:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,怀着真挚的愿望想给我的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to give my children their.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:35.41,2:24:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,公平的享受一个美国式的生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}share of the American way of life.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:37.31,2:24:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,使他们的姓氏和背景 不用背负恶名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}without a blemish on their name and background.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:40.35,2:24:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出席这委员会 并尽可能的合作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have appeared before this committee and given it all my cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:46.89,2:24:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须否认我是罪犯 那对我而言是极为不荣誉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I consider it a great personal dishonour to have to deny that I am a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:53.48,2:24:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望以下几点列入记录中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish to have the following noted for the record:
Dialogue: 0,2:24:56.95,2:24:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在第二次世界大战时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I served my country faithfully.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:58.82,2:25:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忠心及荣耀的 为我的国家服务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in World War Two and was awarded.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:01.29,2:25:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我因保卫我国家的行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Navy Cross for actions.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:03.65,2:25:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而获颁海军十字勋章{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in defence of my country.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:07.13,2:25:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没有因任何罪名 被捕或定罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I have never been arrested or indicted for any crime.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:11.46,2:25:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何证据 使我牵连到犯罪阴谋中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That no proof linking me to any criminal conspiracy.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:15.69,2:25:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是黑手党或是同乡帮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether it is called Mafia or Cosa Nostra.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:18.77,2:25:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,或任何你们想加诸于我的 众所皆知的罪名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or any other name has ever been made public.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:23.06,2:25:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然有权利这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have not taken refuge behind the Fifth Amendment.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:26.14,2:25:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我并未以第五修正案 作护身符{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}although I may do so.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:31.17,2:25:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向这委员会挑战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I challenge this committee.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:33.43,2:25:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,请他们提出任何 不利于我的人证或物证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to produce any witness or evidence against me.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:36.94,2:25:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是他们无法提出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if they do not.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:39.37,2:25:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望他们以相同情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope they will have the decency.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:41.57,2:25:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在大众面前洗清我的名声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to clear my name with the same publicity.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:44.81,2:25:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们现在已完全的 破坏了我的名声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with which they have besmirched it.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:48.04,2:25:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂先生 我确信我们 都留下了深刻的印象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure we're all quite impressed.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:50.85,2:25:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是你对国家的爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Particularly with your love for our country.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:53.55,2:25:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,委员会暂停到下周一上午十点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be in recess until 10 a.m. Monday.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:56.44,2:25:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候本会将提出证人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we will produce a witness.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:58.78,2:26:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,以确定今天对你提出的控诉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who'll corroborate the charges against you.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:01.42,2:26:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时候到了 柯里昂先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And at which time Mr.Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:03.05,2:26:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你非常可能会被证明有罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you may very well be subject to indictment for perjury.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:06.45,2:26:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我提醒你 你必须随传随到 柯里昂先生 休会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remind you that you're still under subpoena.Adjourned!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:14.96,2:26:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,十比一 十比一的机会 你说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten-to-one shot, you said.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:17.76,2:26:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,十比一的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten-to-one shot.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:19.46,2:26:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会采用第五修正案 而我输了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would take the Fifth, and I lose.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:22.79,2:26:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听起来像是我的赌马经纪人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound like my bookie.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:24.96,2:26:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠那傢伙一条命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe that monkey my life.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:28.57,2:26:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好是好好睡一觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, just get a good night's sleep.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:30.43,2:26:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 好好的睡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:32.03,2:26:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天是大日子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a big day tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:34.33,2:26:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你买了新西装 新衬衫和新领带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got you a new suit, new shirt, new tie.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:38.74,2:26:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天我会亲自给你刮胡子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll shave you myself in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:42.14,2:26:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你五千万名美国同胞面前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll look respectable for 50 million.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:44.17,2:26:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会看起来很体面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of your fellow Americans.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:46.24,2:26:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的命 我的命在明天之后 就一文不值了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow… My life won't be worth a nickel after tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:52.51,2:26:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧！我看过了 看了19遍了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! I saw this 19 times.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:57.31,2:26:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的家很漂亮 法兰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a great home here.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:59.95,2:27:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的余生 没人能接近你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the rest of your life.Nobody gets near you.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:02.15,2:27:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那里都不能去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:03.95,2:27:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好极了 美极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great. Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:07.35,2:27:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做的好交易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some deal I made.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:09.49,2:27:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会活的像国王 你会是位英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll live like a king. You'll be a hero.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:12.28,2:27:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里会比多数 在外面的人要活的好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll live better here than most people outside.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:15.38,2:27:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好一个交易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some deal!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:21.62,2:27:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,潘坦居利还活着！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alive. Pentangeli is alive.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:25.98,2:27:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎会找上他的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did they get their hands on him?
Dialogue: 0,2:27:27.89,2:27:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯 是他设计的 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roth. He engineered it, Michael.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:32.03,2:27:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰克想和罗萨多兄弟谈条件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Frankie went to make a deal with the Rosato brothers.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:34.59,2:27:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果他们想杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they tried to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:36.59,2:27:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以为是你出卖了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thought you double-crossed him.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:40.03,2:27:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在纽约的人说 他已经半死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our people with the detectives said he was half dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:42.80,2:27:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓得全身僵硬 大声说你出卖了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}scared, and shouted that you'd turned on him.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:46.20,2:27:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们早就控制他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They already had him on possession.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:47.80,2:27:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,做假帐 一级谋杀 还有很多罪名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}bookmaking, murder one and more.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:52.33,2:27:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦调查局把他看的很紧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The FBI has him airtight.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:55.27,2:27:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在一个陆军基地里 24小时保护{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on an army base, 24 hour guards.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:58.11,2:28:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想接近他是不可能的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't get to him.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:01.14,2:28:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你使自己犯下五项伪证罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've opened yourself to five counts of perjury.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:05.54,2:28:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷多呢？他知道什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Fredo? What does he know?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:08.58,2:28:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他什么都不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says he doesn't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:10.21,2:28:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I believe him.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:12.48,2:28:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯！他这一次耍的够漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roth, he… played this one beautifully.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:24.29,2:28:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和弗雷多谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to talk to Fredo.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:06.10,2:29:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有什么好说的 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't got a lot to say, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:10.41,2:29:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have time.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:13.08,2:29:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被蒙在鼓里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was kept pretty much in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:17.54,2:29:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我晓得的并不多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know all that much.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:20.61,2:29:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about now?
Dialogue: 0,2:29:23.45,2:29:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有什么你知道的 可以帮助我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything you can help me out with? Anything you can tell me now?
Dialogue: 0,2:29:30.31,2:29:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们掌握了潘坦居利 我只能告诉你这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got Pentangeli.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:47.55,2:29:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不晓得会是暗杀 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know it was going to be a hit, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:51.36,2:29:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对天发誓我不晓得会是暗杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to God I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:56.56,2:29:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼欧拉跑来找我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny Ola bumped into me.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:59.09,2:30:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在比佛利山{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Beverly Hills.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:02.76,2:30:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 他想谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said that he wanted to talk.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:07.40,2:30:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说你和罗斯 在合作做宗大买卖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said that you and Roth were in on a big deal together.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:16.04,2:30:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但若我能帮忙 就算我一份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that there was something in it for me if I could help him out.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:20.37,2:30:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 他说你在协调上 态度很强硬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said that you were being tough on the negotiations.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:24.47,2:30:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但若他们能有点协助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if they could get a little help.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:26.74,2:30:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,能很快的完成这笔买卖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and close the deal fast.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:30.38,2:30:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会对家族有益{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would be good for the family.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:34.44,2:30:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信他说的鬼话？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you believed that story?
Dialogue: 0,2:30:37.41,2:30:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信那个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believed that?
Dialogue: 0,2:30:39.21,2:30:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说算我一份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said there was something in it for me.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:41.78,2:30:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我自己的！- 我一向都照料你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- on my own! - I've always taken care of you, Fredo.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:45.59,2:30:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,照料我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taken care of me?!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:48.65,2:30:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我弟弟 你照料我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my kid brother!You take care of me?
Dialogue: 0,2:30:52.45,2:30:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想过那一点吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever think about that?
Dialogue: 0,2:30:54.29,2:30:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾想过那一点吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever once think about that?
Dialogue: 0,2:30:57.69,2:30:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫弗雷多去办这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send Fredo off to do this.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:59.16,2:31:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫弗雷多去办那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}send Fredo off to do that!
Dialogue: 0,2:31:02.46,2:31:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,让弗雷多打理 某处的无名夜总会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let Fredo take care of some Mickey Mouse nightclub somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:07.06,2:31:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫弗雷多去机场接某个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let Fredo fetch somebody at the airport!
Dialogue: 0,2:31:10.33,2:31:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你哥哥 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your older brother.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:11.86,2:31:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我却被你踏在脚下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but was stepped over!
Dialogue: 0,2:31:13.60,2:31:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是爸爸的意思 - 但那不是我要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's the way Pop wanted it. - It's not the way I wanted it!
Dialogue: 0,2:31:18.00,2:31:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能处理事情 我够精明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can handle things, I'm smart!
Dialogue: 0,2:31:20.93,2:31:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像是每个人所说的我很笨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like everybody says.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:24.00,2:31:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很精明 我要被尊重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like dumb. I'm smart and I want respect!
Dialogue: 0,2:31:34.87,2:31:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对这件调查 你能告诉我什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything you can tell me about this investigation?
Dialogue: 0,2:31:38.68,2:31:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何一点点？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything more?
Dialogue: 0,2:31:47.94,2:31:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们所选用的律师奎斯特 是罗斯的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The senate lawyer, Questadt… He belongs to Roth.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:03.79,2:32:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fredo…
Dialogue: 0,2:32:07.85,2:32:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你对我什么也不是？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you're nothing to me now.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:12.43,2:32:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是哥哥 也不是朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a brother, not a friend.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:16.52,2:32:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想知道你及你的所作所为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to know you, or what you do.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:20.89,2:32:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想看见你在旅馆中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to see you at the hotels.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:23.86,2:32:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想你接近我的房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you near my house.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:28.36,2:32:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你要见母亲时 先通知我 好让我避开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you see our mother, I want to know in advance, so I won't be there.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:34.56,2:32:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:46.17,2:32:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mikey.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:54.51,2:32:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,在家母还活着的时候 我不要他发生任何事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want anything to happen to him while my mother's alive.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:48.83,2:33:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里比球赛的人还要多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more people than at a ballgame in here.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:52.20,2:33:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,威力奇契在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there's Willi Cicci!
Dialogue: 0,2:34:16.11,2:34:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,请保持秩序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This committee will come to order!
Dialogue: 0,2:34:21.22,2:34:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,请说你的姓名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}State your name, please.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:22.72,2:34:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰克潘坦居利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank Pentangeli.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:24.25,2:34:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的出生地？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you born?
Dialogue: 0,2:34:25.42,2:34:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞特耐格罗 在巴勒摩的外围{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pontenegro, it's outside of Palermo.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:27.98,2:34:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在住在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you live now?
Dialogue: 0,2:34:30.25,2:34:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和联邦调查局的人 住在陆军营舍中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I live in an army barracks with the FBI guys.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:36.42,2:34:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这终于有一位证人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have here a witness.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:39.09,2:34:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,能进一步的作证 指出麦克柯里昂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that will further testify, to Michael Corleone's.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:42.29,2:34:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这犯罪王国的统领{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}rule of a criminal empire.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:44.43,2:34:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制全国所有的赌博 也许还有别的国家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that controls all gambling.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:47.90,2:34:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位证人与麦克柯里昂之间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This witness has had no buffer.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:49.93,2:34:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有中间人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}between himself and Michael Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:52.66,2:34:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能合作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can corroborate enough charges.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:53.93,2:34:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的控诉就有足够的证据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for us to recommend.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:55.86,2:34:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,让这委员会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a charge of perjury.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:56.93,2:35:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,能对麦克柯里昂的罪进行诉讼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}against Michael Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:00.94,2:35:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 参议员 - 谢谢你 吉姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Senator. - Thank you, Chairman.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:04.24,2:35:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,潘坦居利先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Pentangeli…
Dialogue: 0,2:35:07.14,2:35:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,潘坦居利先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Pentangeli.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:09.57,2:35:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是柯里昂家族的一员吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you a member of the Corleone family?
Dialogue: 0,2:35:12.81,2:35:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否为下述人作事？卡波瑞金 彼得克里曼沙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you serve under Caporegime, Peter Clemenza,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:18.01,2:35:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有人称教父的维多柯里昂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and under Vito Corleone, also known as the Godfather?
Dialogue: 0,2:35:28.35,2:35:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我从来不认得教父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never knew any Godfather.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:33.52,2:35:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有我自己的家族 参议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have my own family.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:39.02,2:35:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,潘坦居利先生 你是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Pentangeli, you…
Dialogue: 0,2:35:41.49,2:35:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在驳斥自己的宣誓笔录{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are contradicting.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:43.69,2:35:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,与你原先所做的 并且签了字的大相矛盾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}your own sworn statement.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:46.32,2:35:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再问你一次 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask you again, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:48.16,2:35:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,此时此地在这情况下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}here and now under oath,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:49.89,2:35:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾经是以麦克柯里昂 为首的犯罪组织的成员吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}were you at any time a member of a crime organisation led by Michael Corleone?
Dialogue: 0,2:35:56.26,2:35:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对那点一无所知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know nothing about that!
Dialogue: 0,2:36:02.09,2:36:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和他的父亲 曾在橄榄油事业共事过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in the olive oil business with his father.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:06.20,2:36:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是很久以前了 如此而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:10.03,2:36:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有份你宣誓的笔录{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a sworn affidavit.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:13.22,2:36:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有你的宣誓口供{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sworn affidavit.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:16.30,2:36:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,指出你奉麦克柯里昂之命 去谋杀人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you murdered on the orders of Michael Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:19.44,2:36:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你否认那份自白书吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you deny this confession.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:21.41,2:36:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否了解 你的否认会有何结果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and do you realise what will happen if you do?
Dialogue: 0,2:36:24.20,2:36:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,调查局的人答应我个条件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The FBI guys promised me a deal.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:27.34,2:36:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我假造很多 麦克柯里昂的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I made up a lot of stuff about Michael Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:31.25,2:36:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那是他们想要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to please them.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:33.28,2:36:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但…那全是谎言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was all lies.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:35.64,2:36:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything!
Dialogue: 0,2:36:38.11,2:36:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不停的说 麦克柯里昂做了这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They kept saying, "Michael Corleone did this"
Dialogue: 0,2:36:42.95,2:36:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克柯里昂做了那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and "Michael Corleone did that".
Dialogue: 0,2:36:46.79,2:36:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我说 是 当然 有何不可{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I said, "Yeah, sure. Why not?"
Dialogue: 0,2:36:51.12,2:36:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:52.61,2:36:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否能告诉本委员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}would you kindly identify.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:55.25,2:36:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐在你左边的那一位是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the gentleman sitting to your left?
Dialogue: 0,2:36:57.32,2:36:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can answer that.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:59.66,2:37:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的名字是文森卓潘坦居利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Vincenzo Pentangeli.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:02.92,2:37:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是否和证人有关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he related to the witness?
Dialogue: 0,2:37:05.59,2:37:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我相信是他的哥哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is, I believe, his brother.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:07.83,2:37:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能到前来宣誓吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will he come forward and be sworn?
Dialogue: 0,2:37:10.26,2:37:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 这个人不了解英文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't understand English.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:12.67,2:37:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自费来此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came at his own expense.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:13.79,2:37:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他弟弟有难时伸出援手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to aid his brother.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:16.33,2:37:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有收到传票 而且他在他自己国家内的名誉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not under subpoena, and his reputation in his own country.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:19.10,2:37:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是相当受尊重的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is impeccable.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:20.23,2:37:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说他对这些事一无所知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows nothing about this?
Dialogue: 0,2:37:22.10,2:37:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我了解是一无所知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To my knowledge, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:24.07,2:37:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要弄清楚这里是怎么一回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to find out what happened!
Dialogue: 0,2:37:26.83,2:37:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在休会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This committee is now adjourned.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:29.16,2:37:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,证人可以退席了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The witness is excused.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:30.40,2:37:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,参议员！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator!
Dialogue: 0,2:37:32.21,2:37:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,参议员！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator!
Dialogue: 0,2:37:33.37,2:37:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个委员会应该道歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This committee owes an apology!
Dialogue: 0,2:37:36.38,2:37:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个委员会应该道歉 参议员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This committee owes an apology. Apology, Senator!
Dialogue: 0,2:38:07.92,2:38:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦克！打扰一下 - 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Michael, excuse me. - Hello, darling.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:12.49,2:38:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们在外面 我们要走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The children are outside. We're going.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:17.22,2:38:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪？我们要回农场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? We're leaving tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:21.06,2:38:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗可 - 需要我时再叫我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rocco? - I'll be in my room, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:29.53,2:38:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 我不回内华达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael, I'm not going back to Nevada.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:32.60,2:38:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带孩子们来向你说再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought the children to say goodbye to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:39.20,2:38:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你知道我为你高兴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:41.93,2:38:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我一直都知道 你太精明了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always knew you were too smart.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:44.63,2:38:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会让他们击败你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to let any of them beat you.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:47.91,2:38:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坐下吧！- 不 我不想久留 不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why don't you sit down? - No, I'm not going to stay long.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:52.58,2:38:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些事我想和你谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are some things I'd like to talk to you about.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:56.88,2:38:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心理有些事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things that have been on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:00.22,2:39:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,某些我想做的改变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}changes I want to make.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:01.81,2:39:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想改变已经太迟了 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's too late for changes, Michael.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:05.95,2:39:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应我自己不说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't going to say anything…
Dialogue: 0,2:39:08.42,2:39:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但现在… - 你说太迟是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but now… - What do you mean, "too late"?
Dialogue: 0,2:39:16.02,2:39:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,潘坦居利究竟发生了何事？麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What really happened with Pentangeli?
Dialogue: 0,2:39:24.66,2:39:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他哥哥来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His brother came and helped him.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:26.89,2:39:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不晓得他有哥哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't even know he had a brother.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:29.86,2:39:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he now?
Dialogue: 0,2:39:32.99,2:39:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在飞机上 回西西里去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on a plane, back to Sicily.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:36.46,2:39:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只要露个脸就行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All he had to do was show his face.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:40.63,2:39:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他们兄弟之间的事 凯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was between the brothers, Kay.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:43.50,2:39:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我无关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:53.30,2:39:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人可以走 你不行 孩子们也不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me you're going, Not you, not the kids.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:56.51,2:40:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到没？你是我的太太 他们是我的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, You're my wife and my children.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:00.57,2:40:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 我不允许 就是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you and won't allow it.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:02.94,2:40:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 你说你爱我 然后你又说允许我离去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say you love me, but talk about allowing me to leave!
Dialogue: 0,2:40:06.94,2:40:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,男人跟女人之间 总是不断的有事发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That have been going on for years between mean and women.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:09.64,2:40:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是永远不变的 如此而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that will not change an that's it.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:10.74,2:40:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦克！…你变得盲目了 - 对什么盲目？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've become blind! - Blind to what?
Dialogue: 0,2:40:13.21,2:40:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看！看我们间发生了什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what's happened to us.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:14.91,2:40:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克！我的天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike!my God,
Dialogue: 0,2:40:16.11,2:40:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们的儿子 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what's happened to our son, Michael.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:18.22,2:40:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么都没有发生 - 别告诉我没发生什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing's happened to him. - Don't tell me nothing's…
Dialogue: 0,2:40:19.95,2:40:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一切都很好 - 一切都不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anthony's fine. - Anthony's not fine!
Dialogue: 0,2:40:21.72,2:40:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不想听！- 你要听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't wanna hear about it. - You will hear about it!
Dialogue: 0,2:40:23.22,2:40:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不想听！- 没有一件事是好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't wanna hear about it! - Anthony's friends…
Dialogue: 0,2:40:24.85,2:40:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不想听 - 你想骗谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't want to hear about it.- are your buttonmen!
Dialogue: 0,2:40:26.39,2:40:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to hear about it!
Dialogue: 0,2:40:29.29,2:40:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over!
Dialogue: 0,2:40:43.66,2:40:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这一刻 我对你毫无爱意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At this moment I feel no love for you at all.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:48.33,2:40:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没想到那会发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never thought that would ever happen.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:51.83,2:40:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但发生了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it has.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:07.54,2:41:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay…
Dialogue: 0,2:41:12.77,2:41:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明天走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're leaving tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:15.34,2:41:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯 你为何不带孩子回房去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you take the kids back to their room?
Dialogue: 0,2:41:18.54,2:41:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 你没听到我说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael, you haven't heard me.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:20.77,2:41:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯 你想要我怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay, what do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,2:41:24.81,2:41:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你期望我会让你走？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you expect me to let you go.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:27.28,2:41:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你期望我会让你 由我身边带走我的孩子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to let you take my children from me?
Dialogue: 0,2:41:31.88,2:41:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道不了解我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you know me?
Dialogue: 0,2:41:33.22,2:41:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道不晓得那是不可能的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you know that.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:35.25,2:41:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是不可能发生的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's an impossibility?
Dialogue: 0,2:41:37.55,2:41:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道我会尽全力 来阻止那件事发生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I'd use all my power to keep that from happening?
Dialogue: 0,2:41:42.15,2:41:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道不晓得吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you know that?
Dialogue: 0,2:41:46.26,2:41:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay…
Dialogue: 0,2:41:51.32,2:41:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这段时间后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In time.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:54.19,2:41:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会有不同的感受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll feel differently.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:57.32,2:42:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会高兴我现在阻止了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be glad I stopped you now.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:02.10,2:42:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我晓得的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:06.10,2:42:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你因为失去胎儿而怪我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you blame me for losing the baby.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:11.23,2:42:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道那对你有何意义{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what that meant to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:18.61,2:42:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会补偿你的 凯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make it up to you, Kay.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:21.44,2:42:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓我会补偿你 我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear I'll make it up to you. I'll…
Dialogue: 0,2:42:25.60,2:42:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会改变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to change.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:28.87,2:42:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会变的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll change.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:30.77,2:42:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我有能力改变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've learned that I have the strength to change.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:35.35,2:42:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你就能忘了这次小产{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you'll forget about this miscarriage…
Dialogue: 0,2:42:39.18,2:42:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再怀一个孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and we'll have another child.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:41.38,2:42:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续生活在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'll go on, you and I.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:43.08,2:42:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我白首偕老{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go on.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:47.99,2:42:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Michael!
Dialogue: 0,2:42:50.69,2:42:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克！你的眼瞎了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael, you are blind.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:54.69,2:43:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是小产 那是坠胎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't a miscarriage.It was an abortion.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:02.59,2:43:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,坠胎！麦克 就像我们的婚姻一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An abortion, Michael. Just like our marriage is an abortion.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:08.66,2:43:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一件不神圣而且邪恶的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that's unholy and evil!
Dialogue: 0,2:43:13.60,2:43:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想要你的儿子！麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want your son, Michael!
Dialogue: 0,2:43:17.02,2:43:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再生一个你的儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't bring another one of your sons into this world!
Dialogue: 0,2:43:22.63,2:43:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是坠胎！麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an abortion, Michael.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:25.20,2:43:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个儿子 儿子 而我杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a son and I had it killed.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:28.33,2:43:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这一切都必须结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because this must all end!
Dialogue: 0,2:43:32.40,2:43:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道现在全结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know now that it's over.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:35.17,2:43:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那时就知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it then.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:37.87,2:43:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有办法了 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There would be no way, Michael.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:40.37,2:43:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远不可能原谅我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}no way you could ever forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:43.48,2:43:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,连这已经延续了二千年的 西西里的传统也不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not with this Sicilian thing that's been going on for 2, 000…
Dialogue: 0,2:43:55.88,2:43:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不准带走我的孩子 - 我会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You won't take my children. - I will.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:59.32,2:44:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不准带走我的孩子 - 他们也是我的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You won't take my children! - They're my children too.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:46.23,2:45:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 你在干什么？不要打架{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sonny.what you doing, don't make a fight.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:45.09,2:47:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,西西欧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ciccio.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:47.09,2:47:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,西西欧阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don Ciccio.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:51.39,2:47:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,西西欧阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don Ciccio.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:54.13,2:47:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,西西欧阁下 是我汤马西诺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don Ciccio, it's Tommasino.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:55.83,2:47:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,容我介绍一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me the honor of introducing someone.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:59.96,2:48:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在美国纽约的合伙人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My partner in America, in New York.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:02.83,2:48:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的名字是维多柯里昂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Vito Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:06.76,2:48:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们由这运橄榄油给他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll send him olive oil from here.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:10.23,2:48:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,运到他美国的公司 杰安可橄榄油公司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To his company in America.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:16.57,2:48:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们进口橄榄油 西西欧阁下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're olive oil importers, Don Ciccio.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:28.54,2:48:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,西西欧阁下 我们想要得到你的祝福{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd like your blessing.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:32.64,2:48:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,及你对我们工作的允许{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your permission to start work.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:36.24,2:48:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位年轻朋友由纽约前来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is this young man from New York?
Dialogue: 0,2:48:42.31,2:48:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他走近一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have him come closer.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:46.48,2:48:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不太清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see him so good.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:56.56,2:48:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,西西欧阁下 我向你致意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My respects, Don Ciccio.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:58.42,2:49:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,请给我你的祝福{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your blessing.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:02.59,2:49:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,保佑你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless you!
Dialogue: 0,2:49:06.60,2:49:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,2:49:08.63,2:49:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫维多柯里昂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vito Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:10.39,2:49:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多柯里昂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vito Corleone.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:13.30,2:49:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用了这村子的名字作姓氏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took the name of this town!
Dialogue: 0,2:49:16.93,2:49:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲的名字呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's your father's name?
Dialogue: 0,2:49:19.20,2:49:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的名字是安东尼奥安东里尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name was… Antonio Andolini.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:23.27,2:49:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,大声点 我的听力不行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louder, I don't hear so good.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:29.97,2:49:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,家父的名字是 安东尼奥安东里尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father's name was Antonio Andolini…
Dialogue: 0,2:49:33.54,2:49:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这是给你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and this is for you!
Dialogue: 0,2:50:58.04,2:51:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克！说再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael, say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:03.64,2:52:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 艾尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Al.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:16.21,2:52:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆 我能与你谈一会吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I speak with you for a second, Tom?
Dialogue: 0,2:52:28.08,2:52:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆 麦克在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom, where's Mike?
Dialogue: 0,2:52:30.95,2:52:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在等你离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for you to leave.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:35.69,2:52:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能与他谈谈吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I talk with him?
Dialogue: 0,2:52:37.83,2:52:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 弗雷多 没有机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Fredo. No chance.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:40.62,2:52:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能见他吗？- 他在会议室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I see him? - He's in the boathouse.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:57.23,2:52:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克！我是康妮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael, it's Connie.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:20.84,2:53:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:25.34,2:53:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是可以的话 我想住在家里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to stay close to home now, if it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:37.41,2:53:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯会来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Kay coming?
Dialogue: 0,2:53:42.42,2:53:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:51.49,2:53:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 弗雷多在家里陪妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fredo's in the house with Mama.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:54.79,2:53:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要求见你 汤姆说你不愿见他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked for you and Tom said you wouldn't see him.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:02.36,2:54:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:07.10,2:54:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们 你们到外面去一会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids, why don't you go outside for a while?
Dialogue: 0,2:54:14.17,2:54:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克！拜托 我想和你谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, I want to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:27.88,2:54:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克！我恨你 那么多年来一直恨你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael, I hated you for so many years.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:32.54,2:54:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去我对我自己所做的事 伤害我自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I did things to myself, to hurt myself.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:36.37,2:54:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样你才晓得 我也伤害了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that you'd know that I could hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:49.29,2:54:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是为了我们大家而坚强就像爸爸以前那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were just being strong for all of us, the way Papa was.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:54.15,2:54:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原谅你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:00.52,2:55:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能原谅弗雷多吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you forgive Fredo?
Dialogue: 0,2:55:03.63,2:55:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是那么的甜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:05.86,2:55:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你是那么的无助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and helpless without you.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:14.73,2:55:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要我 麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need me.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:16.29,2:55:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在想来照顾你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to take care of you now.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:28.34,2:55:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,康妮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connie…
Dialogue: 0,2:57:14.19,2:57:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:27.06,2:57:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的朋友兼生意伙伴 海门罗斯上报了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our friend and business partner, Hyman Roth, is in the news.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:32.06,2:57:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear about it?
Dialogue: 0,2:57:34.43,2:57:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说他在以色列{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear that he's in Israel.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:37.40,2:57:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,以色列的最高法院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The High Court in Israel.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:38.90,2:57:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,驳回他返回以色列居住的申请{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}turned down his request to live there.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:42.13,2:57:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的护照过期了 只好回美国来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His passport's been invalidated, except to return here.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:45.77,2:57:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他昨天飞到布宜诺斯艾利斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He landed in Buenos Aires yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:48.74,2:57:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他提议只要他们准许他居留 他愿拿出一百万元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He offered them a million dollars if they'd let him live there.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:53.70,2:57:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们拒绝了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They turned him down.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:55.91,2:57:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面说他在尝试巴拿马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going to try Panama.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:57.77,2:57:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴拿马不会接受他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Panama won't take him.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:00.03,2:58:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百万或一千万都不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for a million, not for ten million.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:02.78,2:58:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的医疗报告显示他情况很差{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His condition is reported as terminal.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:04.31,2:58:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正只能再活六个月{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's only got six months left.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:07.70,2:58:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的心脏病使他濒临死亡 快20年了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's had the same heart attack for 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:10.90,2:58:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他坐飞机飞往迈阿密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That plane goes to Miami.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:12.71,2:58:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错！我就是要在那儿下手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. That's where I want it met.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:16.15,2:58:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 那是不可能的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:17.88,2:58:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会把他直接交给有关单位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll turn him over to the Internal Revenue.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:19.98,2:58:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是海关接着是联邦调查局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Customs and FBI.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:21.74,2:58:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是不可能的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not impossible.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:24.05,2:58:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何事是不可能的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:25.48,2:58:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就像想刺杀总统一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be like try to kill the president.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:26.98,2:58:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有接近他的办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way we can get to him!
Dialogue: 0,2:58:28.62,2:58:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆 你令我惊讶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom, you surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:33.95,2:58:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,若在这生命中有任何确定的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anything in this life is certain…
Dialogue: 0,2:58:37.52,2:58:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是历史教了我们任何东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if history has taught us anything…
Dialogue: 0,2:58:40.92,2:58:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是你可以杀任何人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's that you can kill anyone.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:48.79,2:58:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗可{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocco?
Dialogue: 0,2:58:50.82,2:58:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,困难 但不是不可能的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Difficult. Not impossible.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:54.13,2:58:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:58.40,2:59:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我进来时就有不对劲 你干嘛还问我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you ask me if something was wrong when I came in?
Dialogue: 0,2:59:05.74,2:59:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你会告诉我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were going to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:09.30,2:59:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把你家搬去拉斯维加斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're moving your family to Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:13.04,2:59:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人请你去当 休斯顿饭店的副总裁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that you'd been offered the Vice Presidency of the Houstan hotels there.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:18.78,2:59:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为你会告诉我 - 我拒绝了他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought you'd tell me that. - I turned them down.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:20.70,2:59:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得告诉你 我每次拒绝的事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must I tell you every offer I turn down?
Dialogue: 0,2:59:27.95,2:59:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们谈正事吧！- 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's do business. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:32.42,2:59:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要考虑一下 麦克 考虑一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just consider this, Michael.Just consider it.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:36.65,2:59:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯和罗萨多兄弟 本来就在跑路了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roth and the Rosatos are on the run.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:38.98,2:59:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这值得吗？我们够强壮吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they worth it, are we strong enough?
Dialogue: 0,2:59:41.96,2:59:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是否值得？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it worth it?
Dialogue: 0,2:59:44.32,2:59:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说你赢了 你还想要干掉每一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've won. Do you want to wipe everybody out?
Dialogue: 0,2:59:47.02,2:59:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得我需要干掉每一个人 汤姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't feel I have to wipe everybody out, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:50.52,2:59:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我的敌人 如此而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just my enemies, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:59.86,3:00:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我要做的事表示同意 还是另有打算？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you with me in these things, or what?
Dialogue: 0,3:00:04.56,3:00:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为若不同意的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if not.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:05.86,3:00:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以带着你太太 你的家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can take your wife, your family.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:08.67,3:00:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,及你的情妇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your mistress.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:10.53,3:00:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部搬到拉斯维加斯去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and move them all to Las Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:16.63,3:00:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何要伤害我？麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you hurt me, Michael?
Dialogue: 0,3:00:18.54,3:00:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一向对你忠心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always been loyal to you.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:19.80,3:00:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说…这是怎么一回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,3:00:26.57,3:00:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…你留下来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… you're staying?
Dialogue: 0,3:00:29.97,3:00:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 我留下 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, I'm staying. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:35.31,3:00:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你要我做的是什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,3:00:37.67,3:00:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,安东尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anthony.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:39.88,3:00:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,安东尼 你想不想…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Anthony…
Dialogue: 0,3:00:41.92,3:00:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我教你如何抓真正的大鱼 如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you like it if I taught you how to catch the really big fish?
Dialogue: 0,3:00:44.65,3:00:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想学吗？- 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you like that? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:47.62,3:00:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我在你这个年纪时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, when I was your age…
Dialogue: 0,3:00:50.48,3:00:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我所有的兄弟一起去钓鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I went out fishing with all my brothers.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:54.15,3:00:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我父亲 大家一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my father. Everybody.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:58.65,3:01:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我是唯一钓到鱼的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the only one that caught a fish.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:01.85,3:01:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我没有人钓到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody else could catch one.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:05.52,3:01:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我怎么做到的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how I did it?
Dialogue: 0,3:01:08.89,3:01:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一次我把钓线丢入水中时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time I put the line in the water.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:10.69,3:01:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说圣母玛丽亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said a Hail Mary.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:12.69,3:01:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次我说圣母玛丽亚 我都钓到鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and every time I said a Hail Mary, I caught a fish.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:18.83,3:01:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you believe that?
Dialogue: 0,3:01:20.33,3:01:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的 那是个秘密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true. That's the secret.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:25.03,3:01:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到湖上时 你想试试吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to try it out on the lake?
Dialogue: 0,3:01:26.90,3:01:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay.- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:29.63,3:01:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还带了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else have you got?
Dialogue: 0,3:01:58.89,3:02:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有事的 法兰克 别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything will be okay.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:01.15,3:02:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥回去了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did my brother go back?
Dialogue: 0,3:02:02.59,3:02:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,走了 别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:05.21,3:02:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他比我凶悍十倍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's ten times tougher than me, my brother.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:08.32,3:02:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是旧式的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's old-fashioned.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:11.46,3:02:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他连出去吃晚饭都不肯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't want dinner.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:12.93,3:02:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只想直接回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just wanted to go home.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:14.69,3:02:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我哥哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my brother!
Dialogue: 0,3:02:15.99,3:02:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何事能让他离开那小镇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing could get him away from that two-mule town.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:19.86,3:02:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可以在这称王的 他可以拥有自己的家族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could have been big here. He could have had his own family.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:29.10,3:02:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆 我现在该怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom, what do I do now?
Dialogue: 0,3:02:34.97,3:02:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankie.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:41.50,3:02:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一向对政治及历史有兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were always interested in politics and history.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:47.17,3:02:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你提到1933年的希特勒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember you talking about Hitler back in '33.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:50.57,3:02:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍然读很多书 我在里面学到不少好东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I still read a lot. I get good stuff in there.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:56.85,3:02:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是老前辈身旁的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were around the old-timers.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:59.51,3:03:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们梦想着应该如何组织家族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who built the organisation of the families.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:02.47,3:03:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们如何以古罗马军团为基础{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}basing them on the old Roman legions.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:04.41,3:03:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还给他们命名为统治者 议事者和军士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with "regimes", "capos" and "soldiers".
Dialogue: 0,3:03:09.35,3:03:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真的成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it worked.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:11.38,3:03:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 它成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it worked.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:14.15,3:03:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是伟大的老日子 你知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those were the great old days, you know.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:17.75,3:03:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就像是罗马帝国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We was like the Roman Empire.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:20.89,3:03:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯里昂家族就像是罗马帝国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Corleone family was like the Roman Empire.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:29.09,3:03:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,它曾经有一度是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it was once.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:35.69,3:03:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankie.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:47.94,3:03:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦对抗帝国的长老失败了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When a plot against the Emperor failed…
Dialogue: 0,3:03:52.73,3:03:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,阴谋者总是保有一次机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the plotters were always given a chance…
Dialogue: 0,3:03:58.04,3:04:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让家族保有财富 对不对？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to let their families keep their fortunes. Right?
Dialogue: 0,3:04:01.90,3:04:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 但那只是有钱人 汤姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the rich guys.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:03.95,3:04:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,小人物呢？他们被打倒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The little guys got knocked off.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:06.27,3:04:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他所拥有的悉数归于帝国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all their estates went to the Emperors.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:08.88,3:04:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非他们回家自杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless they went home and killed themselves.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:12.04,3:04:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就不会发生任何事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:15.35,3:04:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他的家庭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And their families.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:17.35,3:04:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的家庭会被妥善照顾 汤姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}were taken care of.Tom.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:21.58,3:04:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个好的机会 好交易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a good break, a nice deal.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:25.58,3:04:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们回到家里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They went home…
Dialogue: 0,3:04:31.12,3:04:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐在装满热水的浴缸里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sat in a hot bath.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:34.09,3:04:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,把血管割开 流血至死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}opened up their veins and bled to death.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:40.86,3:04:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候他们在自尽之前 还会有个派对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sometimes they had a little party before they did it.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:50.19,3:04:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心任何事 法兰克长老{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about anything, Frankie Five-Angels.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:53.99,3:04:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 汤姆 谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Tom. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,3:05:15.67,3:05:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 汤姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,3:05:17.11,3:05:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 法兰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Addio, Frankie.
Dialogue: 0,3:05:29.98,3:05:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯 你必须走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay… You have to go.
Dialogue: 0,3:05:34.65,3:05:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那么的漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So pretty.
Dialogue: 0,3:05:35.94,3:05:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯 请快点 他来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay, please hurry. He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,3:05:46.92,3:05:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,安东尼 和妈妈吻别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anthony… Kiss Mama goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,3:05:53.26,3:05:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,安东尼 去和你妈吻别 行吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anthony, would you kiss your mother good bye.
Dialogue: 0,3:05:56.42,3:05:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,安东尼 向妈妈说再见 安东尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anthony, say good bye to mama, Anthony.
Dialogue: 0,3:06:01.43,3:06:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}honey I love you.
Dialogue: 0,3:06:02.86,3:06:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯！拜托！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay, please.
Dialogue: 0,3:06:08.07,3:06:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,3:06:22.70,3:06:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莉 到这来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary, come here.
Dialogue: 0,3:06:32.25,3:06:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,安东尼 请你再吻我一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anthony, please. Kiss me once.
Dialogue: 0,3:08:16.42,3:08:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 接稳了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,3:08:24.06,3:08:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,安东尼…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anthony! Anthony!
Dialogue: 0,3:08:27.17,3:08:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这 我们要去钓鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here we're going fishing!
Dialogue: 0,3:08:29.29,3:08:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 麦克现在要带他去雷诺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.Michael want to take him to Reno now.
Dialogue: 0,3:08:33.90,3:08:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,3:08:37.04,3:08:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 孩子 你得和你爸爸去雷诺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, kid, you have to go to Reno with your pop.
Dialogue: 0,3:08:41.51,3:08:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,安东尼 别这样 我明天再带你去钓鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take you fishing tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,3:08:43.54,3:08:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吗？- 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,3:08:48.17,3:08:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That a boy.
Dialogue: 0,3:08:49.30,3:08:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,安东尼 我用那秘密为你钓一条鱼回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Anthony, Listen, I'll catch one for you in secret.
Dialogue: 0,3:08:54.64,3:08:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吗？- 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,3:08:55.97,3:08:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,3:08:58.51,3:09:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾尔 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Al let's go.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:39.66,3:09:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯先生 你了解我必须把你收押{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Roth, I must take you into custody.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:42.23,3:09:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我了解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:43.90,3:09:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能对以色列最高法院作出的裁决{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your reaction to.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:45.48,3:09:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,说一下你的反应吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Israeli High Court ruling?
Dialogue: 0,3:09:47.10,3:09:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个领养老金的退休投资者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a retired investor on a pension.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:50.10,3:09:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去以色列是因为 在我的风烛残年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to Israel to live there as a Jew.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:53.96,3:09:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想以一个犹太人的 身份住在那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the twilight of my life.
Dialogue: 0,3:10:02.63,3:10:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰克 出来吧！我们来玩牌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Frankie! Come on out, let's play some Hearts.
Dialogue: 0,3:10:14.41,3:10:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankie!
Dialogue: 0,3:10:31.71,3:10:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯先生 你的身家真的超过三亿美金？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true you're worth over 300 million dollars?
Dialogue: 0,3:10:35.09,3:10:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是退休的投资者 靠养老金过活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a retired investor, living on a pension.
Dialogue: 0,3:10:38.65,3:10:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来是参加总统大选投票{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came home to vote in the presidential election.
Dialogue: 0,3:10:42.43,3:10:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们不给我 一张缺席的选举票{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because they wouldn't give me an absentee ballot.
Dialogue: 0,3:10:50.16,3:10:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Halt!
Dialogue: 0,3:10:58.30,3:11:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,3:11:01.70,3:11:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣母玛丽亚 祈求你的保佑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hail Mary, full of grace.
Dialogue: 0,3:11:05.07,3:11:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,主与我同在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lord is with thee.
Dialogue: 0,3:11:07.43,3:11:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,赐福予妇女{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blessed art thou amongst women.
Dialogue: 0,3:11:11.01,3:11:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,赐福予你所孕育的果实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blessed is the fruit of thy womb, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,3:11:15.57,3:11:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣母玛丽亚！上帝之母 为我们这群罪人祈祷吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy Mary, Mother of God, pray for us sinners.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:01.36,3:12:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个人 注意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Everybody, pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:05.30,3:12:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我朋友卡洛李兹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my friend Carlo Rizzi.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:07.30,3:12:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我弟弟弗雷多 你认识他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know my brother Fredo.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:08.83,3:12:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 我认识他 - 这是我的养兄汤姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure. - This is my stepbrother Tom.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:12.39,3:12:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他的女友泰瑞莎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's his girl Theresa.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:15.14,3:12:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里这个可人儿是我妹妹康妮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This cute little thing is my sister Connie.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:17.17,3:12:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你提起过的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you about that.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:18.61,3:12:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！向卡洛打招呼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say hello to Carlo.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:20.43,3:12:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他很帅 对吧？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's good-looking? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:23.28,3:12:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个无精打采的傢伙 是我弟弟麦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The droopy thing is Mike.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:25.97,3:12:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们叫他大学生 知道我的意思吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We call him Joe College.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:27.90,3:12:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 坐吧 彼此谈谈 - 坐吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sit down. Talk to each other. - Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:31.87,3:12:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱因斯坦先生…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mr. Einstein…
Dialogue: 0,3:12:37.48,3:12:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蛋糕在这 - 泰西欧来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The cake. - Sally, get in here!
Dialogue: 0,3:12:40.11,3:12:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很害怕 - 来吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was scared. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:43.05,3:12:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,令尊在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your father?
Dialogue: 0,3:12:44.21,3:12:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他去做圣诞节采购快回来了 - 放在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Christmas shopping. - Put here.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:46.55,3:12:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see that thing.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:50.05,3:12:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's nice!
Dialogue: 0,3:12:52.48,3:12:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我应该现在插蜡烛吗？- 插吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Should I put the candles on now? - Yea go on.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:54.45,3:12:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡洛 你帮她好不好？- 当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. You help her, Carlo. - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:56.59,3:12:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 泰西欧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Tessio.
Dialogue: 0,3:12:57.75,3:12:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？兰姆酒吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that? Rum?
Dialogue: 0,3:12:59.02,3:13:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:05.65,3:13:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别偷吃菜 爸回来前别碰菜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey Sonny, don't touch the ante-pasta until Pop gets here.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:09.16,3:13:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yea, come on.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:17.30,3:13:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说日本人的胆量如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think of the nerve of those Japs?
Dialogue: 0,3:13:19.73,3:13:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,想修理那些混蛋吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}those slanty eyed bastards, huh.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:20.93,3:13:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在爸爸生日的这一天 在后院扔炸弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dropping bombs in out back yard and on Pops birthday ya know.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:23.33,3:13:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们并不晓得是爸爸生日 - 他们并不晓得是爸爸生日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now they didn't know it was Pop's birthday. - They didn't know it was Pop's birthday.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:27.03,3:13:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在石油禁运之后 我们就该料到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not surprising after the oil embargo.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:29.30,3:13:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,料想到有什么用 不管料到料不到扔炸弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean expect it,
Dialogue: 0,3:13:30.74,3:13:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都没有扔炸弹的权利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}expect it or not they have no right dropping bombs.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:32.47,3:13:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么？亲日分子？站错边了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you a Jap lover or something are you on their side?
Dialogue: 0,3:13:34.58,3:13:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道今早有三万人志愿从军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand 30, 000 enlisted this morning.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:36.84,3:13:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bunch of saps.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:38.23,3:13:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么是笨蛋？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are they saps?
Dialogue: 0,3:13:39.73,3:13:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,尚尼 别这样 我们不必谈论战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny, come on.We don't have to talk about the war.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:41.94,3:13:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 你去和卡洛聊天 好不好？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey beat it, you go talk to Carlo alright.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:46.68,3:13:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're saps.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:48.24,3:13:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,因他们为陌生人冒生命危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because they risk their lives for strangers.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:50.34,3:13:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是爸爸的语气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that's Pop talking…
Dialogue: 0,3:13:51.51,3:13:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也没错 那是爸爸的语气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're god damn right that's Pop talking.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:53.85,3:13:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为国家冒生命危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They risk their lives for their country.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:55.88,3:13:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这国家不是你的血脉 你要记住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Country isn't your blood, you remember that.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:57.91,3:13:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得是那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't feel that way.
Dialogue: 0,3:13:59.08,3:14:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得是那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well if you don't fell that way.
Dialogue: 0,3:14:00.25,3:14:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你若不觉得是那样 你为何不休学去从军呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}why don't you just quit collage and go to…go to join the Army.
Dialogue: 0,3:14:03.85,3:14:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那么做了 我加入了海军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.I've enlisted in the Marines.
Dialogue: 0,3:14:11.39,3:14:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 你为何不先来找我们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you come to us?
Dialogue: 0,3:14:14.19,3:14:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,此话怎讲？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,3:14:15.39,3:14:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说爸爸花了很大的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean Pop had to pull a lot of strings.
Dialogue: 0,3:14:16.66,3:14:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 才让你缓徵的 - 我没那么要求{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- to get you a deferment. - I didn't ask for it.
Dialogue: 0,3:14:19.69,3:14:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没要求缓徵 我并不想要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I didn't want it.
Dialogue: 0,3:14:22.70,3:14:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是怎么一回事 - 别这样！…别打了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's wrong? - Come on! Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,3:14:25.82,3:14:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尚尼 - 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sonny - Punk!
Dialogue: 0,3:14:27.29,3:14:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尚尼！坐下 - 坐！坐下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sonny, sit down. - Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,3:14:32.36,3:14:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈！爸又在打架了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, Daddy's fighting again!
Dialogue: 0,3:14:39.10,3:14:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带卡洛到客厅去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go and show Carlo the tree.
Dialogue: 0,3:14:46.07,3:14:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克叔叔 妈妈 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Miclael, mama, pop.
Dialogue: 0,3:14:55.37,3:15:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷 你真行 在爸爸的生日上伤他的心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice, real nice, break your fathers heart on his birthday.
Dialogue: 0,3:15:01.51,3:15:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,做的好 麦克 恭喜你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's swell, Mike. Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,3:15:04.31,3:15:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 鼓励他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on encourage him.
Dialogue: 0,3:15:06.35,3:15:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,去 倒杯酒给我 去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want…I want you to get me a drink, go on.
Dialogue: 0,3:15:13.55,3:15:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不了解 你父亲对你有计划的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you don't understand but, uh, your father has big plans for you.
Dialogue: 0,3:15:16.68,3:15:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多次他都提到了你的未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now many times he and I have talked about your future.
Dialogue: 0,3:15:22.85,3:15:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你和我父亲谈我的未来？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Talked to my father about my future? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,3:15:27.86,3:15:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的未来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My future?
Dialogue: 0,3:15:29.39,3:15:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 他对你期望很高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mikey, he has high hopes for you.
Dialogue: 0,3:15:32.29,3:15:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对我的未来有我自己的计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well I have my own plans for my future.
Dialogue: 0,3:15:35.12,3:15:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上大学是去变笨的吗？你真的笨了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you go to collage to get stupid? You're really stupid.
Dialogue: 0,3:15:38.06,3:15:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他回来了 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here come on.
Dialogue: 0,3:15:41.90,3:15:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on…
Dialogue: 0,3:15:46.02,3:15:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨蛋！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,3:16:05.30,3:16:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,大惊喜！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise!
